<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Faptili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Faptili a Apostuljilor</para>
  <para style="toc2">Faptili</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fap</para>
  <para style="mt1">Faptili a Apostuljilor</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Anãltsarea al Isus tu Tser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Prota carti u feciu, Theofile, trã tuti atseali tsi Isusul apãrnji s-facã shi s-nveatsã, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />pãnã tu dzua cãndu s-anãltsã tu tser, dupã tsi avea datã ordin prit Duhlu Sãmtu a apostuljilor tsi elu avea aleaptã. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Isusul, dupã tsi eara munduitã, s-aspusi a lor nyeat cu multi provi, sh-vidzut di partea a lor di patrudzãtsi di dzãli sh-grãinda trã amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Cãndu eara uspetsi deadun cu nãshi, lji ordinã: “Nu vã dipãrtats di Ierusalem, ma s-ashtiptats tãxirea a Tatãlui, tsi avets avdzãt di la mini. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Ioanul pãtidzã cu apã, ma voi va vã pãtidzats cu Duhlu Sãmtu nu dupã multi dzãli.” <verse eid="ACT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ashãtsi atselji tsi eara adunats ningã nãsu lu ntribarã: “Doamne, va u adari tini tora amirãriljea al Israel?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Elu apãndisi: “Nu easti lucrul a vostru sã shtits chirolu sh-oara, tsi ari arãdãpsit Tatãl cu autoritatea a lui. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ma voi va s-loats puteari cãndu Duhlu Sãmtu va s-yinã pri voi, sh-va vã fãtsets martiri a melji tu Ierusalem sh-tu tutã Iudea, tu Samaria sh-pãnã tu mardzina a loclui.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Dupã tsi li dzãsi aesti, cãndu elji ma lu mutrea, lu-anãltsarã tu tser sh-un nior lu lo dit ocljilji a lor. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Sh-cum tsãnea ocljilji cãtrã tser, cãndu elu ma s-anãltsa, ia doi bãrbats cu stranji albi stãturã nãintea a lor, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />sh-lã dzãsirã: “Bãrbats di Galilea, cãtse stats sh-mutrits cãtrã tser? Aestu Isus, tsi s-anãltsã tu tser dit mesea a voastrã, va si s-toarnã ashã cum fudzi, cum lu vidzut cã s-alinã tu tser.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matia Ljea Loclu al Iuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Atumtsea elji s-turnarã tu Ierusalem di pri muntili tsi s-acljeamã a Masnjilor, tsi easti aproapi di Ierusalem cãt easti imnarea a Sãmbãtãljei. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Cum s-turnarã tu cãsãbã, s-alinarã tu udãlu di analtu, iu stãtea Petrul, Ioanul, Iacovul, Andrea, Filipul, Toma, Bartolomeu, Mateu, Iacovul al Alfeu, Simon Zelotlu sh-Iuda al Iacovu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Tuts aeshti eara cu unã singur minduiri tu rugãciuni deadun cu muljerili, cu Maria, muma al Isus sh-cu fratslji a lui.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Tu atseali dzãli Petrul si sculã namisa di ucenitsilji, (iu numirlu a oaminjlor adunats eara anvãrliga di unã sutã sh-yinghits), sh-dzãsi: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Frats sh-surãri, prindi tra si mplineascã aestã Scriturã, la cai Duhlu Sãmtu u pridzãsi cu gura al David trã Iuda, cai s-featsi cãlãuzlu atsilor tsi lu acãtsarã Isusul. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Elu eara numirat deadun cu noi sh-avea parti tu aestã huzmitipsiri. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Elu acumpãrã un agru cu arãsplata a nindriptatiljei. Aclo cãdzu cu caplu nghios, lj-cripã pãnticlu sh-tuti atseali a lui di nãuntru lji si virsarã. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Aestã s-featsi cunuscutã la tuts bãnãtorlji di Ierusalem, sh-agrul tu limba a lor s-acljimã Acheldama, tsi va s-dzãcã Agrul a sãndzilui). <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Ia, tsi easti scriatã tu cartea a Psalnjilor:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Casa a lui si s-facã shcretã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">sh-vãrã s-nu bãneadzã tu nãsã!’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Shi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Altul s-u ljea huzmitipsirea a lui.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Prindi, tsi unu di bãrbatslji cai eara deadun cu noi tut chirolu tsi Domnul Isus ari intrat sh-ari ishit namisa di noi, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />apãrnjinda di la pitedzlu al Ioan sh-pãnã tu atsea dzuã cãndu u loar di la noi sh-lu anãltsarã tu tser, si s-facã martir cu noi trã nyearea a lui.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Atumtsea s-numirã doi: Iosiful, acljimat Barsaba (tsi eara cunuscut Iustu), sh-Matia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Deapoea s-rugarã sh-dzãsirã: “Tini, Doamne, tsi cunoshti ininjli a tutulor, aspuni cai di aeshti doi ai aleaptã, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />trã loari soartea aishtei huzmitipsiri apostolicã, di la cai Iuda s-dipãrtã si s-ducã tu loclu a lui.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Atumtsea arcarã soarti sh-soartea cãdzu pri Matia. Elu s-lugursi cu unsprãdzatsi Apostulji.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Duhlu Sãmtu Dipunã tu Dzua a Rãshailor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Cãndu vini dzua a Arusaljilor, elji eara tuts deadun singur tu idyiul loc. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ni-ashtiptat dit tser s-avdzã unã vãziri, ca atsea a vimtului tsi suflã vãrtos shi s-umplu tutã casa iu stãtea elji. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Atumtsea elji vidzurã niscãnti limbi ca di foc, tsi s-mpãrtsa shi acãtsa loc pristi cathiun di elji. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Ashãtsi tuts s-umplurã cu Duhlu Sãmtu sh-apãrnjirã si zburãscã pi alti limbi, ashã cum Duhlu Sãmtu lã-u dãdea si zburãscã. <verse eid="ACT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ma tu Ierusalem bãna niscãntsã Iudei, tsi avea fricã di Dumnidzãlu di tuti natsiunili cai suntu sum tser. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Cãndu s-avdzã aestã vãziri, multsãmea s-adunã shi s-ciudisi, cã cathiun di elji lji avdza grãinda tu limba a lor. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Tuts s-ciudisea, s-thãvmãtisea sh-ntriba un-alantu: “Ia, nu suntu tuts Galileanji aeshti cai grescu? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Cum vahi cathiun di noi lji avdi si zburãscã pri limba a noastrã maternã? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Noi Partsã, Medzi, Elamitsi, bãnãtorlji di Mesopotamia, di Iudea, di Capadochia, di Pontu sh-di Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />di Frighia sh-di Pamfilia, di Eghyptu sh-di pãrtsãli a Libiãljei ningã Tsirenea, sh-vinitslji di Roma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Iudei sh-prozelits, Cretanji sh-Araghi, lji avdzãm si zburãscu trã mãri lucri a Dumnidzãlui tu limbili a noastri!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Tuts s-ciudisea sh-eara cihtisits sh-dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Tsi va s-dzãcã aestã?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Iarã altsã arãdzãnda dzãtsea: “Suntu mplinji di yin dultsi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrul Lji greashti a Multsãmiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ma Petrul si sculã pri cicioari deadun cu Unsprãdzatsilji sh-lã grãi a lor cu boatsi analtã: “Iudei sh-voi tuts cai bãnats tu Ierusalem, loats-u aestã hãbari sh-avdzãts cu cãshtiga zboarili a meali. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Aeshti nu suntu mbitats, ashã cum minduits voi, cã oara easti noauã a dimineatsãljei. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ma aestã easti atsea tsi eara dzãsã prit prufitlu Ioel:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Tu dzãlili di soni, dzãtsi Dumnidzãlu, va s-undzeascã ashãtsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Mini va sã scurpisescu di Duhlu a meu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">pristi tuts oaminjlji.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Hiljilji a voshtri sh-hiljili a voastri va s-prufitipseascã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">tinirlji a voshtri va veadã viziunea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">sh-aushlji a voshtri va nyiseadzã.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Tu atseali dzãli va sã scurpisescu di Duhlu a meu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">pristi huzmichearlji a melji sh-pristi huzmichearili a meali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">sh-va s-prufitipseascã.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Va s-fac thavmati nsus pri tser</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">sh-seamni nghios pri loc,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">sãndzi, foc sh-aburi di fum.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Soarili va si s-toarnã tu scutidi sh-luna tu sãndzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">nãinti tra s-yinã dzua atsea marea sh-mãritã a Domnului.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Atumtsea caitsido tsi va s-acljeamã numa a Domnului, va s-ascapã.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Bãrbats Israelits, ascultats aesti zboari: Isus Nazareanlu, eara omlu alihipsit di la Dumnidzãlu ntru voi cu fapti mãri, cu thavmati shi seamni tsi Dumnidzãlu featsi namisa di voi prit nãsu, cum lu shtits sh-voi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Aestu om dupã planul atsel arãdãpsitul sh-dupã pricunushtearea a Dumnidzãlui, s-prideadi la voi sh-voi lu acãtsat sh-prit mãnjili atsilor nindreptsã, lu crutsisit sh-lu vãtãmat. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ma Dumnidzãlu lu ari nyeat, dupã tsi lu dizligã di durearili a moartiljei, cã nu eara putut tsi moartea s-lu tsãnea. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Davidul dzãtsi trã nãsu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Domnul lu avui dipriunã nãintea a mea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">cã elu easti tu nandreapta a mea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">tsi mini s-nu mi min.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Trã atsea s-hãrsi inima a mea shi s-hãrãcupsi limba a mea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">sh-truplu a meu va s-discurmã tu nãdii.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Cã tini nu va lu alashi suflitlu a meu tu Colasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">sh-nu va alashi tsi Sãmtul a tãu s-veadã putridzarea.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Tini nj-ai aspusã cãljurili a banãljei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">tini va mi umpli di harauã nãintea a fatsãljei a ta.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Frats sh-surãri, pot s-vã dzãc discljis trã patriarhul David cã elu muri shi s-ngrupã, sh-murmintul a lui easti aoa la noi pãnã tu dzua di azã. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Metsi, elu eara prufit, shtia cã Dumnidzãlu lji si eara spigiurat cã vãrã di simintsa a truplui va s-bagã pri thronlu a lui. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Prividãnda aestã, elu grãi di nyearea a Hristolui, dzãcãnda cã elu nu va si s-alasã tu Colasi sh-truplu a lui nu va s-veadã aspãrdzeari. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Aestu Isus, Dumnidzãlu lu ari nyeat sh-trã aestã tuts noi him martirii. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Elu easti anãltsat tu nandreapta a Dumnidzãlui sh-ari loat di la Tatãl tãxirea a Duhlui Sãmtu sh-ari virsatã atsea cai voi tora videts sh-avdzãts. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Cã Davidul nu s-alinã tu tser, ma elu idyiul dzãtsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Domnul lji ari dzãsã a Domnului a meu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">“Shedz tu nandreapta a mea,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />pãnã cãndu mini va ts-li bagã neamitsilji a tãlji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">ca scamnu la cicioarili a tali.”’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />S-u shtibã ghini tutã casa al Israel cã atsel Isus tsi voi lu avets crutsisit, Dumnidzãlu lu ari faptã Domnu sh-Hristos.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Cãndu li avdzãrã aesti, si nvirinarã tu inimã shi ntribarã Petrul sh-apostulji: “Frats, tsi prindi s-fãtsem?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Atumtsea Petrul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mitãnjusits-vã sh-cathiun di voi si s-pãteadzã tu numa al Isus Hristos trã ljirtarea a amãrtiilor. Ashãtsi, voi va loats doara a Duhlui Sãmtu. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Cã tãxirea easti trã voi, trã cilimenjlji a voshtri, trã tuts atselji cai suntu diparti sh-trã atselji tsi Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a nostru va lji acljeamã.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petrul mãrtirsi sh-cu ma multi zboari alti sh-lã dimãndã dzãcãnda: “Ascãpats-vã di aestã gheneratã arauã.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Atselji tsi lu apruchearã zborlu a lui, s-pãtidzarã. Atsea dzuã s-adãvgarã anvãrliga di trei njilji di oaminji.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adunarea a Pistimenjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Elji eara ipiminisits tu nvitsãtura a apostuljilor sh-tu unitati, tu frãndzearea a pãniljei sh-tu rugãciuni. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Tuts lã acãtsã frica, cã multi seamni sh-thavmati s-fãtsea di mãna a apostuljilor. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Tuts atselji tsi pistipsea eara deadun sh-itsido lu avea deadun. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Elji vindea ciuflichili sh-averili sh-lã-u mpãrtsa a tutulor dupã ananghea a cathiunui. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Cathi dzuã stãtea deadun tu templu, frãndzea pãnea prit cãsi, loa hranã cu harauã sh-cu inima discljisã. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Elji alãvda Dumnidzãlu avãnda bunãtati nãintea a tut popului. Domnul lji-adãvga a bisearicãljei cathi dzuã atselji tsi eara ascãpats.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Petrul Vindicã Dicunjarlu Shcljiop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Petrul sh-Ioanul ma s-alina deadun tu templu tu oara trei dupã prãndzu tu chirolu a rugãciuniljei. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Aclo eara un om shcljiopu di cãndu s-eara amintat, tsi lu adutsea cathi dzuã shi lu alãsa aproapi di usha a templui, tsi s-acljima “Mushata”, tra s-cãfta dicunji atsilor tsi intra tu templu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Elu, cãndu vidzu cã Petrul sh-Ioanul ma intra tu templu, lã cãftã dicunji. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Atumtsea Petrul cu Ioanul, mutrinda cãtrã nãsu tu oclji, lji dzãsirã: “Nã mutrea!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Sh-elu ma lã mutrea cu cãshtigã, nãdãinda cã va loa tsiva di la nãshi. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Ma Petrul dzãsi: “Mini nu am nitsi asimi, nitsi furii, ma atsea tsi am ma ts-u dau. Tu numa al Isus Hristos Nazareanlu scoalã-ti sh-imnã!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Deapoea Petrul lu acãtsã di mãna atsea ndreapta sh-lu sculã pri cicioari. Tu oara atsea lji si nvãrtushirã cicioarili sh-noadili. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Sh-cu unã ansãriturã si sculã pri cicioari sh-apãrnji s-imnã. Intrã cu nãshi tu templu imnãnda, ansãrãnda sh-alãvdãnda Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Tutã lumea lu mutrea imnãnda sh-alãvdãnda Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Elji cãndu lu cunuscurã cã eara atsel tsi shidea nãinti di poarta atsea Mushata a templui sh-cãfta dicunji, s-thãvmãtisirã shi s-ciudisirã trã atsea tsi lji avea undzitã a lui. <verse eid="ACT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Atumtsea shcljioplu cai eara vindicatã stãtea ndupirat la Petrul sh-la Ioanul. Tutã lumea ciudisit fudzi troarã dupã elji la porticlu tsi s-acljima al Solomon.<verse eid="ACT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zborlu al Petru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Cãndu lu-vidzu Petrul aestã, lji grãi a popului: “Bãrbats Israelits, cãtse vã ciudisits di aestã? Cãtse nã mutrits ashã canda noi cu putearea a noastrã di singur sh-cu dumnidzãsirea s-aveam faptã tsi aestu om s-imna? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Dumnidzãlu al Abraham, al Isac sh-al Iacov, Dumnidzãlu a pãrintsãlor a noshtri lu ari multumãritã huzmichearlu a lui Isus, tsi voi lu prideadit la Pilat sh-lu alipidat nãintea a lui, cu tutã cã elu avea apofãsit s-lu sãlãghea. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Voi lu alipidat atsel Sãmtul sh-Ndreptul shi cãftat s-vã sãlãgheascã un vãtãmãtor. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Voi vãtãmat Dãtãtorlu a banãljei, tsi Dumnidzãlu lu ari nyeat dit mortsã. Trã aestã noi him martirii. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Voi lu cunushtets aestu om shcljiopu tsi videts. Elu pistipsi tu numa al Isus sh-aestã l-nvãrtushi. Pistea tsi yini di la Isus lji deadi a lui aestã vindicari ntreagã nãintea a voauã tuts. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Mini tora u-shtiu, frats, cã voi u-avets faptã di nishtirea, ashã cum au faptã sh-mãrlji a voshtri. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Dumnidzãlu ari mplinitã ashãtsi atseali tsi avea dzãsã cu gura a prufitsilor a lui, cã Hristolu va si s-munduia. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Trã atsea mitãnjiusits-vã sh-turnats-vã la Dumnidzãlu s-vã ashteargã amãrtiili a voastri, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />shi s-yin chirolu a diznjirdariljei di Domnu, sh-ashãtsi elu vã pitreatsi Hristolu tsi easti Isusul, arãdãpsit ma nãinti trã voi. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Tserlu prindi s-lu aproachi pãnã tu oara a ntiniririljei a tutulor trã cai Dumnidzãlu ari grãit prit gura a tuts sãmtsãlor prufits a lui di tu ahurhita a etiljei. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Moisiul ari dzãsã: ‘Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a vostru, va scoatã trã voi namisa di fratslji a voshtri un prufit ca mini. Ascultats-lu tu tuti zboarili tsi va s-vã dzãcã! <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Caitsido tsi nu va lu ascultã aestu prufit, va si s-ashteargã dit populu.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Tutashã tuts prufitsilji di la Samuel sh-n'coa au grãit sh-li au hãbãrsitã aesti dzãli. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Voi hits hiljilji a prufitsilor sh-a pisti-ligãturiljei tsi featsi Dumnidzãlu cu pãrintsãlji a noshtri, dzãcãnda al Abraham: ‘Tu dupãyinitura a ta va s-ghinicuvãnteadzã tuti fãrili a loclui.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Dumnidzãlu, dupã tsi lu-nyie huzmichearlu a lui Isus, vã-lu pitricu ma nãinti a voauã tra s-vã ghinicuvãnteadzã, dipãrtãnda cathiun di voi di la cãljurili a voastri atseali arali”.<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Petrul sh-Ioanul Nãintea al Sinedriu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Iarã elji ma lã grea a popului, preftsãlji, comandantul a templui sh-Saduceilji s-apruchearã la elji, <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />nãritsã cã nvitsa sh-hãbãrsea a lumiljei nyearea a mortsãlor prit Isusul. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Atumtsea acãtsarã Petrul sh-Ioanul sh-lji bãgarã tu hapsi pãnã tu alantã dzuã, metsi eara ntunicat. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Multsã di atselji tsi avea avdzãtã zborlu pistipsirã sh-numirlu a bãrbatslor agiumsi aproapi tsintsi njilji. <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Tu alantã dzuã, mãrlji, aushlji shi scriblji s-adunarã tu Ierusalem, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />deadun cu arhipreftul Anna sh-cu Caiafa, Ioanul, Alexandrul sh-tuts atselji cai eara di soia a arhipreftsãlor. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Deapoea lji-bãgarã atsia namisa, sh-lji ntribarã: “Cu tsi puteari icã tu numa a cui u fetsitã aestã?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Atumtsea Petrul, umplut di Duhlu Sãmtu, lã dzãsi a lor: “Mãrlji a popului sh-aushlji! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Noi azã nã giudicãm di unã ghineatsã tsi s-featsi la un om niputut sh-cu tsi fuchii s-vindicã elu. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Nvitsats-lu voi tuts sh-ntreg populu al Israel cã aestã s-featsi tu numa al Isus Hristos Nazareanlu, tsi voi lu crutsisit, ma Dumnidzãlu lu nyie dit mortsã! Di la nãsu aestu om sta nãintea a voastrã vindicat.<verse eid="ACT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />‘Aestã easti cheatra tsi voi, masturlji u-arcat nghios ma s-featsi cheatra a chioshiljei.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ascãparea nu yini di vãrã altu, cã a oaminjlor nu lã easti datã vãrã altã numã sum tser, prit cai s-putem s-nã ascãpãm.” <verse eid="ACT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Elji, cãndu l-vidzurã curaiulu a Petrului sh-a Ioanului shi shtinda cã eara oaminji ninvitsats sh-fãrã shtiintsã, s-ciudisirã sh-lji cunuscurã cã avea fut cu Isusul. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Cãndu lu vidzurã omlu atsel vindicat deadun cu nãshi, nu putea s-dzãtsea tsiva contra. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Cu tutã atsea lã ursirã s-easã nafoarã dit Sinedriul shi zburãrã cu un-alantu, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />dzãcãnda: “Tsi s-fãtsem noi cu aeshti oaminji? Cã easti cunuscut la tuts tu Ierusalem cã easti faptã unã thavmã mari di elji sh-noi nu putem s-u alipidãm. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ma, tsi aestã s-nu si scurpiseascã ma multu tu popul, s-lji lãhtãrsim s-nu lã-greascã a vãrui tu aestã numã.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Atumtsea lji acljimarã sh-lji ursirã s-nu greascã dip shi s-nu nveatsã tu numa al Isus. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ma Petrul sh-Ioanul lã apãndisirã a lor, “Giudicats voi, tsi easti ndreptu nãintea a Dumnidzãlui, s-vã ascultãm ma multu a voauã dicãt Dumnidzãlu! <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Cã noi nu putem s-nu zburãm trã atseali tsi avem vidzutã sh-avem avdzãtã.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Elji dupã tsi lji lãhtãrsirã nãpoi, lji alãsarã s-fugã niaflãnda sibepi cã cum s-lji giudicã trã itia a popului, cã tuts multumãrea Dumnidzãlu trã atsea tsi eara faptã. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Omlu tsi eara vindicat prit aestã thavmã eara ma multu di patrudzãtsi di anji.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pistimenjlji s-Roagã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Cãndu sãlãghirã, Petrul sh-Ioanul s-turnarã la a lor sh-lã spusirã tuti tsi mãrlji a preftsãlor sh-aushlji lã avea dzãsã. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Cãndu li avdzãrã aesti, elji tuts deadun anãltsarã boatsea cãtrã Dumnidzãlu sh-dzãsirã: “Doamne, tini eshti Dumnidzãlu tsi ai adratã tserlu, loclu, amarea sh-itsido tsi easti la eali. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Tini lj-ai dzãsã a huzmichearlui a tãu, tatãl a nostru David prit Duhlu Sãmtu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Trã tse s-nãrãirã natsiunili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">sh-populjilji minduescu lucri fãrã ufelii?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Amiradzlji a loclui s-etimãsirã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">sh-domnjilji s-adunarã deadun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">contra a Domnului sh-contra a Hristolui a lui.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Ps 2:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Dealihea contra a Isusului, Huzmichearlui a tãu sãmtu, tsi tini lu aumsesh, s-adunarã tu aestu cãsãbã Herodul sh-Pontius Pilat cu pãngãnjlji sh-cu populu al Israel, <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />tra s-facã atseali tsi mãna a ta sh-vrearea a ta avea apofãsitã di ma nãinti cã va s-undzea. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Sh-tora, Doamne, mutrea lãhtãrsirili a lor sh-dã a huzmichearilor a tãlji curaiu s-dimãndã zborlu a tãu. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Tindi-u mãna a ta trã vindicari sh-trã adrari seamni sh-thavmati tu numa a Huzmichearlui a tãu sãmtu Isus.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Cãndu s-rugarã elji, loclu iu eara adunats s-cutrimburã. Atumtsea tuts s-umplurã di Duhlu Sãmtu sh-lu dimãndarã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui cu curaiu.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pistimenjlji Mpartsã Itsido cu Un-Alant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Tuts atselji tsi pistipsea eara cu unã singur inimã sh-cu un singur suflit. Vãrã nu dzãtsea trã atseali tsi avea, cã eara a lui, ma tuti lucrili eara a tutulor. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Apostulji mãrtirsea cu fuchii mari nyearea a Domnului Isus sh-harul atsel marli eara cu elji. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Ntrã elji nu eara vãrã oarfãn, cã tuts atselji tsi avea agri icã cãsi li vindea sh-adutsea amintaticlu di lucrili tsi vindea, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />sh-li bãga la cicioarili a apostuljilor. Deapoea a cathiunui lji si dãdea dupã ananghea. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ashãtsi sh-Iosiful, un Levit amintat tu Chipro, acljimat di apostulji Barnaba (tsi va s-dzãcã “hiljilu a diznjirdariljei”), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />avea un agru, lu vindu sh-amintaticlu lu bãgã la cicioarili a apostuljilor.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Anania sh-Muljearea a lui, Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Un om cu numa Anania, deadun cu muljearea a lui Safira, avea vindut un agru. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Elu tsãnu trã nãsu unã parti a amintaticlui cu shtirea a muljeariljei a lui. Deapoea alanta u-deadi sh-u bãgã la cicioarili a apostuljilor. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Atumtsea Petrul lji dzãsi: “Anania, cãtse Satanlu s-umplu inima s-arãdz Duhlui Sãmtu shi s-lu tsãnj unã parti di amintaticlu a agrului? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ma s-avea armasã ni-vindut, nu va eara a ta? Sh-dupã tsi lu-vindush, nu eara tu mãna a ta? Cãtse lu bãgash tu inimã aestu lucru? Tini nu arãseshi oaminjlji, ma Dumnidzãlu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Cãndu avdzã aesti zboari, Anania cãdzu mpadi sh-deadi suflitlu. Unã fricã mari vini pri tuts atselji tsi li avdzãrã aesti. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Si scularã ndoi tiniri, lu nviscurã, lu scoasirã nafoarã sh-lu ngruparã. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Aproapi trei oarã ma nãpoi vini muljearea a lui, tsi nu shtia tsi eara faptã. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petrul lj-dzãsi a ljei: “Dzã-nji, lu vindut loclu ti ahãt?” Sh-ea dzãsi: “Ie, ti ahãt.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Atumtsea Petrul lj-dzãsi: “Cãtse vã featsit pi unã minti tra s-cãrtits Duhlu a Domnului? Ia, cicioarili atsilor tsi lu ngruparã bãrbatlu a tãu suntu la ushã sh-elji va ti scoatã nafoarã sh-tini.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Dinãoarã ea cãdzu la cicioarili a lui sh-deadi suflitlu. Tinirlji intrãnda nãuntru, u aflarã moartã. U scoasirã nafoarã sh-u ngruparã ningã bãrbatlu a ljei. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Tutã bisearica sh-tuts atselji tsi li avdzãrã aesti li acãtsã unã fricã mari.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apostulji Vindicã Multsã Oaminji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Multi seamni sh-thavmati s-fãtsea tu popul prit mãnjili a Apostuljilor. Tuts pistimenjlji s-fãtsea pi unã minti shi s-aduna la porticlu al Solomon. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Vãrã di alantsã nu cutidza s-aduna cu elji, iarã populu lji alãvda. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Ashãtsi numirlu a bãrbatslor sh-a muljerilor tsi pistipsea la Domnul, crishtea totãna sh-ma multu. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Lãndzitslji lji scutea nafoarã pi cali sh-lji bãga pri paturi sh-pi tãrdzi tsi cãndu s-tritsea Petrul aumbra a lui s-aumbreadzã vãrã di elji. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Unã multsãmi mari di cãsãbadzli di anvãrliga al Ierusalem s-aduna. Elji adutsea lãndzits sh-atselji tsi eara munduits di duhuri nicurati, sh-tuts s-vindica.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Avinarea a Apostuljilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Atumtsea, si sculã arhipreftul sh-tuts atselji tsi eara cu nãsu, sectul a Sadutseilor tsi s-umplurã cu inati, <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />sh-acãtsarã apostulji sh-lji bãgarã tu hapsea publicã. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Noaptea, un anghil a Domnului discljisi ushili a hapsiljei, lji scoasi nafoarã sh-lã dzãsi: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Imnats, stãtets tu templu sh-predicats a popului tuti zboarili a banãljei aishtei.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Cãndu avdzãrã aesti, elji intrarã tu templu tahina sh-nvitsa oaminjlji. Cãndu vini arhipreftul sh-atselji tsi eara cu nãsu, acljimarã deadun Sinedriul sh-tuts aushlji a hiljilor al Israel. Deapoea pitricurã vigljitorlji la hapsi tra s-adutsea apostulji. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ma cãndu vigljitorlji agiumsirã la hapsi, nu lji aflarã apostulji aclo. Cãndu s-turnarã deadirã hãbari, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />dzãcãnda: “Noi u-aflãm hapsea ncljisã sh-siguripsitã, tutashã vigljitorlji nafoarã stãnda nãintea a ushilor. Cãndu li discljisim, nu aflãm vãrã nãuntru.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Cãndu comandantul a vigljitorilor a templui sh-arhipreftsãlji li avdzãrã aesti zboari, s-cihtisirã sh-minduirã cã tsi eara aestã. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Deapoea vini un tsi lã hãbãrsi a lor sh-lã dzãsi: “Ia, bãrbatslji tsi voi lji bãgat tu hapsi, suntu tu templu nvitsãnda populu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Atumtsea, comandantul cu vigljitorlji a templui s-dusi sh-lji adusirã fãrã di zori, cã avea fricã di populu s-nu lji agudea cu chetri. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ashãtsi lji adusirã shi lji bãgarã nãintea al Sinedriu. Arhipreftul lji ntribã: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Nu vã ursim cu aspru s-nu nvitsats tu atsea numã? Ia, voi avets umplut Ierusalemlu cu nvitsãtura a voastrã sh-cãftats s-cadã pri noi sãndzili a omlui atsilui.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petrul sh-apostulji lj-apãndisirã: “Prindi s-ascultãm Dumnidzãlu ma multu dicãt oaminjlji. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Dumnidzãlu a pãrintsãlor a noshtri nyie Isusul, tsi voi lu vãtãmatã spindzurãnda tu lemnu. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Dumnidzãlu u anãltsã tu nandreapta a lui sh-lu featsi Prints sh-Ascãpãtor tra s-lji da al Israel mitãnjiusirea sh-ljirtarea a amãrtiilor. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Noi him martiri trã aesti zboari deadun cu Duhlu Sãmtu, tsi Dumnidzãlu lã-l-deadi atsilor tsi ascultã elu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Cãndu avdzãrã aesti, elji s-nãrãirã multu sh-minduirã s-lji vãtãma. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ma un Fariseu cu numa Gamaliel, nvitsãtor di Lege sh-tinjisit di tut populu, si sculã tu Sinedriu sh-ursi s-lji scoatã nafoarã apostulji di putsãn chiro. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Deapoea lã dzãsi atsilor tu Sinedriu: “Bãrbats Israelits! Minduits-vã ghini trã atsea tsi va s-fãtsets cu aeshti oaminji. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Nãinti di aesti dzãli si sculã Teuda, dzãcãnda cã eara vãrã. Anvãrliga di nãsu s-adunarã multsã bãrbatsi, aproapi patru suti. Elu s-vãtãmã sh-tuts atselji tsi lu urma s-arãspãndirã sh-nu armasi tsiva. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Dupã atsea, tu dzãlili di reghistrari a popului, si sculã Iuda Galileanu tsi astrapsi dupã nãsu mults oaminji. Elu s-vãtãmã sh-tuts atselji tsi lu avea urmat s-dipãrtarã. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Trã atsea mini vã dzãc: Stats diparti di aeshti oaminji sh-alãsats-lã s-fugã, cã macã planul aestu icã aestu faptu easti di la oaminji, va si s-dãrãmã. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ma, macã easti di la Dumnidzãlu, nu putets s-lu dãrãmats, cã va vã aflats tu alumtã contra a Dumnidzãlui!” Elji lu ascultarã zborlu a lui. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Deapoea lji acljimarã apostulji, lji bãturã sh-lji ursirã s-nu greascã tu numa al Isus shi lji sãlãghirã. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ashãtsi apostulji fudzirã di Sinedriul tutã harauã, cã s-lugursirã axiusits tsi trapsirã arushinarea trã numa al Isus. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Cathi dzuã tu templu sh-pri cãsi, nu pãpsea s-nvitsa shi s-predica hãbarea atsea buna cã Isusul easti Hristolu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Alidzearea a Shaptilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Tu atseali dzãli iarã numirlu a ucenitsilor ma crishtea, Iudeilji cai grea gãrtseshti murmurea contra a Iudeilor cai grea uvreieshti, cã veduvili a lor ma s-alãsa dupã mãnã cu huzmitipsirea di cathi dzuã. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Atumtsea di doisprãdzatslji acljimarã tutã comunitatea a ucenitsilor sh-dzãsirã: “Nu easti ghini trã noi s-alãsãm dinãparti zborlu al Dumnidzãu shi s-nã apucãm cu measili. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Trã atsea, frats, alidzets namisa di voi shapti bãrbats cu numã bunã, umplut di Duhlu Sãmtu sh-cu mintimenilji, tra s-lji bãgãm tu aestu lucru. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Noi va s-armãnem rugãnda sh-predicãnda zborlu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Aestã minduiri lj-arsi a multsãmiljei. Aleapsirã Stefanlu, un bãrbat cu multã pisti sh-cu Duhlu Sãmtu, Filipul, Prohorul, Nikanorul, Timonul, Parmenul sh-Nicola, un prozelit di Antiochia. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Aeshti lji dusirã nãintea a apostuljilor cai s-rugarã sh-bãgarã mãnjili pri nãshi. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ashãtsi zborlu a Dumnidzãlui si scurpisea. Numirlu a ucenitsilor tu Ierusalem crishtea trãoarã. Tutashã sh-multsã preftsã pistipsirã la Isusul sh-lji si-cãndãrsirã a lui.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acãtsarea al Stefan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Stefanlu, om mplin di har sh-puteari, fãtsea thavmati sh-seamni mãri tu popul. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Atumtsea niscãntsã di sinagoga tsi s-acljima a Liberatslor, a Tsireneilor, a Alexandrinjlor, sh-atsilor di Chilichia sh-Asia si scularã si ncãcea cu Stefanul. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Cu tutã atsea elji nu putea s-ncuntra a mintimeniljei sh-a Duhlui cu cai elu grea. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Atumtsea pri ascumtu bãgarã niscãntsã oaminji s-dzãtsea: “Noi avem avdzãt Stefanul s-greascã zboari di blãstenji contra al Moisiu sh-contra al Dumnidzãu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ashãtsi cãrtirã populu, aushlji sh-scriblji. Deapoea s-apruchearã, lu acãtsarã sh-lu dusirã nãintea a Sinedriului. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Aclo adusirã martiri arãdioshi cai dzãtsea: “Omlu aestu nu pãpseashti s-greascã zboari contra aishtui loc sãmtu sh-contra a Legiljei. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Noi lu avem avdzãt dzãcãnda cã aestu Isus Nazareanlu va lu aspargã aestu loc sh-va s-alãxeascã adetsili tsi nã ari alãsatã Moisiul.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Tuts atselji cai shidea tu Sinedriul arcarã ocljilji pi Stefanlu sh-vidzurã cã fatsa a lui eara ca fatsa a unui anghil.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Zborlu al Stefan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Atumtsea arhipreftul ntribã Stefanlu: “Suntu alihioasi aesti lucri?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Elu apãndisi: “Bãrbats, frats sh-pãrintsã, ascultats! Dumnidzãlu a mãririljei lji si fãnirusi a tatãlui a nostru Abraham cãndu elu eara ninga tu Mesopotamia, nãinti tsi s-bãna tu Haran. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Dumnidzãlu lj-dzãsi a lui: ‘Eshi di loclu a tãu shi di soia a ta sh-duti tu loclu tsi mini va tsã aspun.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Ahr 12:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Atumtsea elu ishi dit loclu a Caldeilor sh-bãnã tu Haran. Dupã tsi lj-muri tatã-su, Dumnidzãlu l-mutã di aclo sh-lu adusi tu aestu loc iu bãnats tora voi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Aclo nu lj-deadi mushtiniri nitsi unã palmã di loc, ma lj-deadi zborlu cã va lji-u da tu domnilji a lui sh-a mushtinitorilor a lui dupã nãsu, cu tutã cã Abrahamul ninga nu avea cilimean.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Ahr 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:4">15:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Dumnidzãlu lj-dzãsi: ‘Dupãyinitorlji a tãlji va s-bãneadzã ca xenji patru sutã di anji tu un loc xen, sh-aclo va s-hibã tu sclãyii sh-va s-tirãnseascã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Ahr 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ma mini va u-giudicã fara a cui elji va lj-huzmitipseascã ca sclayi,’ dzãsi Dumnidzãlu. ‘Sh-dupã aesti elji va easã sh-va nji huzmitipseascã a njia tu aestu loc.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Ex 3:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Deapoea lji deadi al Abraham pisti-ligãtura a anvãrliga-tãljeariljei. Ashãtsi al Abraham lji si amintã Isac sh-lu anvãrliga-tãlje a opta dzuã. Al Isac lji si amintã Iacovul, sh-al Iacovul doisprãdzatsi patriarhi. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Patriarhilji avãnda inati Iosiful lu vindurã tu Eghyptu, ma Dumnidzãlu eara cu nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Elu lu ascãpã di tuti munduirili a lui, sh-lji deadi har sh-mintimenilji nãintea al Faraon, amirãlu al Eghyptu, tsi lu acljimã guvernator al Eghyptu sh-pristi tutã casa a lui. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Deapoea vini unã foami di pãni tu tut Eghyptu sh-Canaan shi s-featsi unã mari strimturã sh-pãrintsãlji a noshtri nu afla ti mãcari. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Cãndu Iacovul avdzã cã tu Eghyptu avea grãn, pitricu aclo prota oarã pãrintsãlji a noshtri. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />A doaua oarã Iosiful s-featsi cunuscut la fratslji a lui sh-ashã Faraonul s-cunuscu cu Fumealja al Iosif. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Atumtsea Iosiful pitricu s-acljima tatãl a lui Iacov sh-tutã soia a lui. Tuts deadun s-fãtsea shaptidzãtsi sh-tsintsi di sufliti. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ashãtsi Iacovul s-dusi nghios tu Eghyptu sh-aclo muri, elu sh-pãrintsãlji a noshtri. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Deapoea trupurili a lor s-dusirã nãpoi tu Sichem shi s-bãgarã tu murmintul tsi Abrahamul avea acumpãrat cu tinjii di asimi di hiljilji al Hamor tu Sichem. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Cãndu ma s-apruchea chirolu di tãxirea tsi Dumnidzãlu lj-avea faptã al Abraham, populu crishtea shi s-multsa tu Eghyptu. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Atumtsea tu Eghyptu s-featsi amirã un om cai nu l-cunushtea Iosiful.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Ex 1:7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:8">8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Atsel lucra cu ilei contra a popului a nostru sh-lji strindzea pãrintsãlji a noshtri s-alãsa cilimenjlji a lor s-moarã. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Tu aestu chiro s-amintã Moisiul cai eara mushat tu ocljilji a Dumnidzãlui. Elu s-hrãni di trei meshi la casa a tatã-sui. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Cãndu lu apãrãtsirã lu lo hiljea al Faraon sh-lu criscu ca hiljilu a ljei. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Ashãtsi Moisiul s-nvitsã cu tut mintimeniljea a Eghypteanjlor sh-eara vãrtos tu zboari sh-tu fapti. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Anda umplu patrudzãtsi di anji, lj-amintã tu inimã vrearea s-njidzea s-videa fratslji a lui, hiljilji al Israel.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11">Ex 2:11</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 2:12">12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Cãndu vidzu cã a unui ma lji si fãtsea unã nindriptati, elu lu apãrã sh-lo arãzgãnari vãtãmãnda Eghyptianlu. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Moisiul minduea cã fratslji a lui va lu aduchea cã Dumnidzãlu ma dãdea ascãpari prit mãna a lui, ma elji nu lu aduchirã. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Alantã dzuã Moisiul vidzu doi oaminji tsi ma s-bãtea, sh-elu cãftã s-lji puituea: ‘Bãrbats, voi hits frats! Cãtse fãtsets nindriptati la un-alantu?’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:13">Ex 12:13</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 12:14">14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Atsel tsi ma lj-fãtsea nindriptati a aproapilui a lui, l-pimsi Moisiul dzãcãnda: ‘Cai ti bãgã tini ma mari sh-giudicãtor pristi noi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:14">Luc 12:14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Nacã vrei s-mi vatsãnji sh-mini cum vãtãmashi aieri Eghyptianlu?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Cãndu avdzã aestu zbor, Moisiul fudzi tu loclu al Madiam shi s-featsi xen aclo, iu lji si-amintarã doi ficiori.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:15">Ex 2:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Dupã patrudzãtsi di anji, a Moisiului lji si fãnirusi tu shcretuirea a Muntilui Sinai un anghil a Domnului tu fleaca a foclui a unui rug.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30-31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Ex 3:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:3">3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Cãndu u-vidzu aestã pãreari Moisiul s-ciudisi. S-apruche tra videa ma ghini, sh-avdzã boatsea a Domnului tsi lj-dzãsi:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:4-10">Ex 3:4-10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Mini escu Dumnidzãlu a pãrintsãlor a tãlji, Dumnidzãlu al Abraham, al Isac sh-al Iacov.’ Moisiul trimurãnda ntreg nu avea curaiu s-lu mutrea. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Atumtsea Domnul lj-dzãsi a lui: ‘Dizleagã sandalili di cicioari, cã loclu iu ma stai easti sãmtu. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Mini u am vidzut ghini jalea a popului a meu tu Eghyptu sh-am avdzãt suschirãrili a lor, sh-mi am dipunat s-lji ascap. Tora, haidi cã va ti pitrec tu Eghyptu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Aestu eara idyiul Moisiu tsi elji lu avea alipidat, dzãcãnda: ‘Cai ti bãgã tini ma marli sh-giudicãtor?’ Atsel lu pitricu Dumnidzãlu ca domnu sh-arãscumpãrãtor cu mãna a anghilui tsi lji si-aspusi la rug. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Elu lji scoasi nafoarã dit loclu al Eghyptu, fãcãnda thavmati sh-seamni tu Eghyptu, tu Amarea-Atsea Roshea sh-tu irnjii di patrudzãtsi di anji.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Ex 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Num 14:33</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Aestu easti Moisiul tsi lã dzãsi a hiljilor al Israel: ‘Dumnidzãlu va amintã trã voi namisa di fratslji a voshtri un prufit ca mini.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Deut 18:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Aestu easti atsel cai tu adunarea a popului tu irnjii eara cu anghilu tsi lj-grea pri Muntili Sinai sh-cu pãrintsãlji a noshtri. Elu lo zboari yii tra s-nã li da a noauã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-6">Ex 19:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">20:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:4-22">Deut 5:4-22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:10">9:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Ma pãrintsãlji a noshtri nu vrurã s-ascultã aestu. Elji lu arnisirã sh-cu ininjli a lor s-turnarã cãtrã Eghyptu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:13">Num 14:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Elji lji dzãsirã al Aaron: ‘Fã-nã ndoi dumnidzadz tra s-nã cãlãuzeascã, cã nu shtim tsi lj-ari undzit al Moisiu, cai nã scoasi dit loclu al Eghyptu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Ex 32:1</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 32:23">23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Tu atseali dzãli featsirã un yitsel, lj-adusirã curbani a idolui shi s-hãrsirã cu faptili a mãnjilor a lor.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4-6">Ex 32:4-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Atumtsea Dumnidzãlu s-dipãrtã di elji sh-lji alãsã s-adoreascã stealili a tserlui, ashã cum easti scriatã tu cartea a prufitsilor:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Casa al Israel, nj-avets adusã a njia tãljeari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">sh-curbãnji aesti patrudzãtsi di anji tu irnjii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42,43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25">Am 5:25</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Voi avets purtat tenda al Moloc</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">shi steaua a dumnidzãlui a vostru Refan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">figuri tsi li adrat ti ncljinari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Tr-atsea va vã pitrec surghiuni di napãrti a Babilonlui.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Pãrintsãlji a voshtri tu irnjii avea Tenda a mãririljei, ashã cum avea ursit atsel tsi lj-avea dzãsã al Moisiu, s-u fãtsea dupã figura tsi avea vidzut.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:9">Ex 25:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Pãrintsãlji a noshtri, dupã tsi u loarã tenda, u purtarã deadun cu Ioshua tu loclu tsi avea acãtsatã pãngãnjlji, tsi Dumnidzãlu li avinã nãintea a pãrintsãlor a noshtri. Aclo armasi pãnã tu dzãlili al David.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Ios 3:14-17</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Elu aflã har nãintea a Dumnidzãlui sh-cãftã s-afla unã casã trã Dumnidzãlu al Iacov. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Solomonu lj-adrã a lui unã casã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Amr 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2 Cro 3:1-17</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ma Atsel Ma Analtu nu bãneadzã tu cãsi adrati di mãnjili a oaminjlor, ashã cum dzãtsi prufitlu:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Tserlu easti thronlu a meu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">sh-loclu easti scamnul a cicioarilor a meali.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Tsi casã va nj-adrats voi, dzãsi Domnul,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">icã cai va s-hibã loclu iu va mi discurmã?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:49-50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:2">2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Nu li featsi mãna a mea tuti aesti lucri?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Popul rebil cu ininji sh-ureclji tsi nu avdu Dumnidzãlu, sh-voi ashãtsi ca pãrintsãlji a voshtri totãna ncuntrats Duhlu Sãmtu!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa 63:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Cai di prufitsilji nu avinarã pãrintsãlji a voshtri? Elji vãtãmarã atselji tsi prihãbãrsirã vinita a Ndreptului, iarã voi tora hits faptsã prudots sh-vãtãmãtorlji a lui. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Voi hits atselji cai loat legea dimãndatã di la anghilji, ma nu u-tsãnut.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Cãndu oaminjlji al Sinedriul avdzãrã aesti zboari, elji s-nãrãirã shi cãrtsãnirã dintsãlji contra al Stefan. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ma Stefanul mplinã di Duhlu Sãmtu sculã ocljilji cãtrã tser sh-vidzu mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui sh-Isusul stãnda tu nandreapta a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Atumtsea elu dzãsi: “Ia, mini ma ved tserlu discljis sh-Hiljilu a Omlui stãnda tu nandreapta a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ma elji ncljisirã urecljili sh-cu aurlari vãrtoasi sh-pi unã minti tutsã si sãlãghirã pristi nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Deapoea lu trapsirã azvara nafoarã dit cãsãbã sh-lu agudirã cu chetri. Martirlji bãgarã stranjili a lor la cicioarili a unui tinir acljimat Saul. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Iarã lu agudea cu chetri, Stefanul s-ruga: “Doamne Isus, aproachi-l suflitlu a meu!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Deapoea cãdzu pri dzinuclji sh-grãi cu boatsi analtã: “Doamne, nu lã-u ngarcã a lor aestã amãrtii!” Sh-cum dzãsi aesti durnji.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Saulu avea aprovat vãtãmarea al Stefan.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Avinarea sh-Arãspãndirea a Bisearicãljei</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Tu aestã dzuã s-featsi unã priaĝuniri mari contra a bisearicãljei tu Ierusalem, sh-tuts s-dipãrtarã prit locurili a Iudeiljei sh-a Samariiljei. Mash apostulji nu fudzirã. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Niscãntsã oaminji dumnidzãsits lu ngruparã Stefanul sh-plãmsirã cu boatsi ti nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Iarã Saulu ma aspãrdzea bisearica, intrãnda casã di casã trãdzea azvara bãrbats shi muljeri sh-lji bãga tu hapsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Fap 22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipul Predicã Hristolu tu Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ghini-ma atselji cai eara arãspãndits njidzea iutsido anvãrliga dimãndãnda zborlu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipul dipunã tu cãsãbãlu al Samarii sh-predicã a lor Hristolu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Cãndu multsãmea tutã lu avdzã Filipul shi vidzu seamnili tsi elu fãtsea, elji lj-bãgarã oarã ma multã a zboarilor tsi elu dzãtsea. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Duhuri nicurati cu boatsi analtã ishea di la oaminji, sh-multsã paralizats shi shcljiochi s-vindicarã. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ashãtsi tu atsel cãsãbã fu unã harauã mari.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simonul Mãyistru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Tu atsel cãsãbã bãna un om cu numa Simon cai fãtsea mãyii sh-lji ciudisea oaminjlji di Samaria, sh-dzãtsea cã eara om mari. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Tuts, di la marli pãnã la njiclu bãga mintea la zboarili a lui dzãcãnda: “Aestu om easti Putearea al Dumnidzãu acljimat Mari.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Elji bãga mintea a zboarilor a lui, cã di multu chiro lji avea ciudisitã cu mãyiili a lui. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ma, cãndu lj-pistipsirã al Filip tsi ma dimãnda Evanghelu a amirãriljei al Dumnidzãu sh-numa al Isus Hristos, s-pãtidzarã bãrbats sh-muljeri. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Atumtsea pistipsi sh-idyiul Simon. Dupã tsi s-pãtidzã, stãtu cu Filipu shi s-ciudisea vidzãnda seamnili sh-faptili atseali mãri tsi fãtsea elu. <verse eid="ACT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Cãndu apostulji tu Ierusalem avdzãrã cã Samaria avea aprucheatã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui, pitricurã aclo Petrul sh-Ioanul. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Elji s-dipunarã shi s-rugarã tra s-apruchea Duhlu Sãmtu, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />cã la vãrã di atselji di Samaria nu avea vinit Duhlu Sãmtu. Elji mash eara pãtidzat tu numa a Domnului Isus. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Atumtsea Petrul sh-Ioanul bãgarã mãnjili pristi nãshi sh-elji loarã Duhlu Sãmtu. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Cãndu Simonul vidzu cã Duhlu s-deadi prit bãgarea a mãnjilor a apostuljilor, lã deadi a-lor pãradz <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />dzãcãnda: “Dats-nji sh-a njia aestã puteari, tsi pristi atsel tsi va s-bagã mãnjili, elu s-ljea Duhlu Sãmtu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ma Petrul lj-dzãsi: “S-cherã tini deadun cu pãradzãlji a tãlji, cã tini minduish cã pots s-amintsã cu pãradz doara a Dumnidzãlui! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Tini nu ai parti shi soarti tu atsel lucru, cã inima-a ta nu easti ndreaptã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Mitãnjiusea-ti di atsea anapudii a ta shi roagã-ti a Domnului, vahi ti ljearti ti atsea tsi ai tu inimã. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Cã ved cã tini eshti mplin cu amãreatsã sh-ligat di amãrtii.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Atumtsea Simonul lj-apãndisi: “Rugats-vã a Domnului ti mini, tra s-nu nji undzeascã tsiva di atseali tsi nj-dzãtsesh.” <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Dupã tsi Petrul sh-Ioanul avea mãrtirsit sh-avea predicat zborlu a Domnului, elji s-turnarã tu Ierusalem, predicãnda hãbarea atsea buna la multi hoari a Samariiljei.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipul sh-Etiopianul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Un anghil a Domnului lj-dzãsi al Filip: “Scoalã-ti shi du-ti cãtrã sud tu calea tsi dipuni di Ierusalem cãtrã Gaza.” Atsea easti unã cali shcretã. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Filipul si sculã sh-fudzi. Aclo elu vidzu un eunuc Etiopian, un om ufitsial al Candachei, amirãroanjea Cushitã. Elu tsãnea ayishtearea a ljei sh-avea vinit trã alãvdari la Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Tora ma s-turna shidzãnda tu cãrutsa a lui sh-cãntãnda cartea al prufitu Isaia. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Atumtsea Duhlu lj-dzãsi al Filip: “Du-ti la cãrutsã shi stãi aproapi di nãsã!” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipul s-dusi trãoarã la cãrutsã sh-avdzã atsel cãntãnda prufitul Isaia sh-lu ntribã: “U aducheshti atsea tsi ma cãntsi?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Elu lj-dzãsi: “Cum pot s-aduchescu mini ma nu mi agiutã vãrã?” Dupã aestã acljimã Filipul tra s-alina shi-s shidea la cãrutsã ningã nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Loclu a Scrituriljei tsi elu ma cãnta eara aestã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Elu s-dusi ca oaia trã tãljeari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">ca un njel tsi pãpsi nãintea a tundeariljei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">sh-elu nu u discljisi gura.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Tu tãpinusirea a lui lj-alipidarã ndriptatea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Cai poati s-greascã trã dupãyinitorlji a lui?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Cã bana a lui s-tãlje tu mesi pri loc.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Isa 53:7-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Eunuclu ntribã Filipul: “Dzã-nji, trã cai ma greashti prufitul aoa? Trã nãsu icã trã vãrã altu?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Atumtsea Filipul discljisi gura ahurhinda di aestã Scriturã sh-elu aspusi hãbarea atsea buna trã Isusul. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Cãndu ma imna, agiumsirã tu un loc iu avea apã sh-eunuclu dzãsi: “Ia, aoa ari apã. Tsi mi ncheadicã mini tra s-mi pãtedz?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />[Filipul lj-dzãsi: “Ma s-pistipseashti cu tutã inimã, pots s-u fats.” Sh-elu apãndisi: “Mini pistipsescu cã Isus Hristolu easti Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">atselu stih nu s-aflã tu manuscrisili atseali veaclji.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Elu ursi s-chindrueascã cãrutsa. Filipul sh-eunucul s-dusirã la apã sh-Filipul l-pãtidzã. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Cãndu ishirã di apã, Duhlu a Domnului u arãchi trãoarã Filipul sh-eunuclu nu l-vidzu ma. Deapoea fudzi tu calea a lui mplinã di harauã. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipul s-aflã tu Azot, sh-imnãnda pri cali predica hãbarea atsea buna la tuti cãsãbadzli pãnã cãndu agiumsi tu Cesarea.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saulu Pistipseashti la Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Saulu tsi cãnusea totãna ninga sh-cu moarti ucenitsilji a Domnului, s-dusi la arhipreftul <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />shi lji cãftã tsi aestu s-lji scria cãrtsã ti sinagodzãli di Damasc, cu idea tsi ma s-afla vãrã tsi eara di Cala a Domnului, bãrbat icã muljeari, s-lji adutsea ligat tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Cãndu ma cãlãtorea sh-ma s-apruchea di Damasc, ni-ashtiptat strãlutsi anvãrliga di nãsu unã lunjinã dit tser. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Elu cãdzu mpadi sh-avdzã unã boatsi tsi lj-dzãsi: “Saul, Saul cãtse mi priaĝuneshti?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saulu ntribã: “Cai eshti tini, Doamne?” Elu lj-apãndisi: “Mini escu Isusul, tsi tini lu priaĝuneshti! <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Scoalã-ti sh-intrã tu cãsãbã, sh-aclo va s-tsã dzãcã cã tsi prindi s-fatsi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bãrbatslji cai cãlãtorea cu nãsu armasirã fãrã zboari, cã u avdzãrã boatsea, ma nu vidzurã vãrã. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saulu si sculã di mpadi, sh-cu tutã cã ocljilji lji avea discljisi, nu videa. Atumtsea luãnda di mãnã lu dusirã tu Damasc. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Elu di trei dzãli nu videa, nu mãcã sh-nu biu. <verse eid="ACT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Aclo tu Damasc eara un ucenic cu numa Anania. Domnul lj-dzãsi a lui tu viziuni: “Anania!” Elu lj-apãndisi: “Ia iu escu, Doamne.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Domnul lj-dzãsi: “Scoalã-ti sh-duti la calea tsi s-acljeamã ‘Ndreapta’ sh-caftã la casa al Iuda un om di Tarsu cu numa Saul, cã elu ma s-roagã. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Elu ari vidzut tu viziuni un om cu numa Anania cai intrã n-casã sh-bãgã mãnjili pri nãsu tra s-videa dinou.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Atumtsea Anania apãndisi: “Doamne, am avdzãtã di la multsã oaminji cã cãti arali lã au faptã a sãmtsãlor a tãlji aestu om tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Iarã aoa ari vinit cu autoritati di la arhipreftsãlji tra s-bagã prãnghi a tutulor tsi greascã numa a ta.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ma Domnul lj-dzãsi: “Duti, cã elu easti hãlatea a mea tsi mini u-am aleaptã tra s-fac cunuscut numa a mea nãintea a pãngãnjilor, amiradzlor sh-a hiljilor al Israel. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Mini va lji aspun a-lui cã cãtã multu lipseashti s-mundueascã trã numa a mea.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Atumtsea Anania s-dusi sh-intrã tu atsea casã, bãgã mãnjili pri Saulu sh-lji dzãsi: “Frate Saul, Domnul Isus, tsi s-aspusi pri cali cãndu yineai aoa, mi pitricu tra s-vedzi nãpoi shi s-ti umplji di Duhlu Sãmtu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Dinãoarã lj-cãdzu tsiva ca luspã di oclji, sh-a lui lji vini nãpoi videarea. Deapoea si sculã shi s-pãtidzã. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Dupã tsi mãcã, lji si turnã fuchia. Saulu armasi niscãnti dzãli cu ucenitsilji tu Damasc.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulu tu Damasc sh-tu Ierusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Deapoea apãrnji s-preadicã tu sinagodzi shi s-dzãtsea cã Isusul easti Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Tuts atselji tsi lu avdza, s-ciudisea sh-dzãtsea: “Nu easti aestu atsel tsi tu Ierusalem dãrãmã atselji tsi alãvda Isusul? Elu vini aoa cu scupolu tra s-lji ducã ligats nãintea a arhipreftlui.” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Saulu s-nvãrtushea totãna sh-ma multu shi lji tulbura Iudeilji cai bãna tu Damasc, alihipsãnda cã Isusul eara Hristolu. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Cum tricurã niscãnti dzãli, Iudeilji apofãsirã deadun s-lu vãtãma. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ma Saulu nvitsã planul a lor. Noaptea sh-dzua elji vigljea portsãli a cãsãbãlui tra s-putea s-lu vãtãma <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji lu loarã noaptea sh-lu dipunarã di prit cãrpãtura a unui mur cu un cosh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23-25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Cor 11:32,33 </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Cãndu agiumsi la Ierusalem, Saulu cãftã s-apruchea di ucenitsilji, ma tuts avea fricã di nãsu, cã nu pistipsea cã elu eara ucenic. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Cu tutã atsea, Barnaba lu lo, lu adusi la apostulji sh-lã spusi cã cum Saulu tu cali avea vidzut Domnul cai lj-avea zburãtã sh-cum tu Damasc avea zburãtã discljisã tu numa al Isus. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Atumtsea Saulu stãtea cu apostulji, intrãnda sh-ishinda di Ierusalem sh-predicãnda cu curaiu tu numa a Domnului. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Elu zbura sh-discuta cu Iudeilji Elinofonji, iarã elji cãfta s-lu vãtãma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Cãndu fratslji nvitsarã aestã, lu dipunarã Saulul tu Cesarea sh-di aclo lu pitricurã tu Tarsu.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ashãtsi tu tutã Iudea, tu Galilea, sh-tu Samaria bisearica avea pace shi s-nãintea. Bãnãnda cu frica a Domnului, s-crishtea cu diznjirdarea a Duhlui Sãmtu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enea sh-Tabita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Cãndu Petrul ma tritsea prit tuti locurili, s-dusi sh-la sãmtsãlji cai bãna tu Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Aclo aflã un om cu numa Enea, cai di optu anji eara dzãcut tu pat, cã eara paralizat. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Atumtsea Petrul lj-dzãsi: “Enea, Isus Hristolu ti vindicã. Scoalã-ti sh-ndreadz patlu!” Elu si sculã trãoarã. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Tuts bãnãtorlji di Lida sh-di Sharon l-vidzurã shi s-turnarã la Domnul.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />La Ioppa eara unã ucenicã cu numa Tabita (cai tradus va s-dzãcã Gazela). Ea totãna adra fapti buni sh-dãdea dicunji. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Tu atseali dzãli ea s-lãndzãi sh-muri. Dupã tsi u aspilarã cu apã u bãgarã tu udãlu di nsus. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lida eara aproapi di Ioppa sh-ucenitsilji cãndu avdzãrã cã Petrul eara aclo pitricurã la nãsu doi bãrbats sh-lji si rugarã: “Haidi la noi fãrã amãnari!” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Atumtsea Petrul si sculã sh-fudzi cu nãshi. Cãndu agiumsi, lu dusirã la udãlu di nsus. Tuti veduvili s-apruchearã plãngãnda shi spunãnda a lui tunicãli shi stranjili cai li avea faptã Gazela, cãndu eara cu eali. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petrul lji scoasi tuts nafoarã, cãdzu pri dzinuclji shi s-rugã. Deapoea s-turnã cãtrã moarta shi lj-dzãsi: “Tabita, scoalã-ti!” Ea discljisi ocljilji sh-vidzãnda Petrul, si sculã mproastã. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petrul lji-deadi mãna sh-u sculã. Deapoea acljimã sãmtsãlji sh-veduvili, sh-u bãgã nãintea a lor nyeat. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Tu tutã Ioppa u nvitsarã aestã sh-multsã pistipsirã la Domnul. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Tu aestã oarã Petrul stãtu niscãnti dzãli tu Ioppa la casa a unui Simon, lucrutor di cheali.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Corneliu sh-Petrul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Tu Cesarea eara un om cu numa Cornel. Elu eara tsenturion a cohortãljei tsi s-acljima Italica. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Corneliu eara datã cãtrã Dumnidzãlu sh-avea fricã di nãsu deadun cu Fumealja a lui. Elu dãdea multu dicunji a popului shi s-ruga dipriunã a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Un mirindi, anvãrliga di oara trei, vidzu limpid tu unã viziuni un anghil al Dumnidzãu cai intrã la nãsu sh-lji dzãsi: “Corneliu!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Elu ncãrfusi ocljilji cu fricã sh-lu ntribã: “Tsi easti, Doamne?” Anghilu lj-apãndisi: “Rugãciunjili sh-dicunjãli a tali au agiumtã nãintea al Dumnidzãu sh-elu ti adusi aminti. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Pitreats tora ndoi bãrbatsi tu Ioppa la Simonul tsi s-acljeamã Petrul. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Elu sheadi la Simon tãbãcarlu cai lu ari casa ningã amarea.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Cãndu s-dipãrtã anghilu tsi grãi cu nãsu, Corneliu acljimã doi di huzmichearlji a lui sh-un suldat dumnidzãsit di atselji tsi lj-shãdea totãna aproapi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Dupã tsi lã aspusi itsido lã pitricu tu Ioppa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Viziunea al Petru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Alantã dzuã cãtrã njeadzã-dzuã iarã elji ma imna sh-ma lji s-apruchea a cãsãbãlui, Petrul s-alinã tu taratsã anvãrliga tra s-ruga. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Elu avea foami sh-vru s-mãca. Iarã atselji di casã ma lj-ndridzea mãcarea, elu s-arãchi tu extazã. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Atumtsea vidzu tserlu discljis sh-unã ca pãndzã mari ligat tu patruli pãrtsi cai ma dipuna cãtrã nãsu pri loc. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Tu pãndzã s-afla tuti soili a nimaljilor cu patru cicioari, azvãrnitorilji a loclui sh-puljilji a tserlui. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Atumtsea s-avdzã unã boatsi cai lj-dzãsi: “Scoalã-ti Petro! Talji sh-mãcã!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Iarã Petrul dzãsi: “Nu, vãrãoarã Doamne. Mini nu am mãcat vãrãoarã tsiva lãvushitã sh-nicuratã.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Boatsea lj-dzãsi nãpoi di a doaua oara: “Nu li acljeamã nicurati atseali tsi Dumnidzãlu li curã.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Atsea undzi trei ori, sh-apoea dinãoarã pãndza s-alinã nãpoi tu tser. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Iarã Petrul ma s-minduea s-aduchea cã tsi eara viziunea tsi avea vidzutã, agiumsirã oaminjlji pitricuts di Corneliu. Elji ntribãnda s-apruchearã la poartã sh-aflarã casa al Simon. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Deapoea acljimarã sh-ntribarã macã stãtea aclo Simonul tsi s-acljima Petru. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Iarã Petru ma s-minduea ninga di viziunea, Duhlu lji dzãsi: “Simon, trei oaminji ma ti caftã.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niscãnti manuscrisi au tu apãrnjitã trei, niscãnti alti au niscãnti sh-tu unã singur doi. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Scoalã-ti sh-dipunã-ti, duti cu nãshi shi s-nu eshti niapofãsitã, cã mini lji pitricui.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petrul dipunã la atselji bãrbats sh-lã dzãsi: “Mini escu atsel tsi cãftats. Cãtse avets vinitã?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Elji lj-dzãsirã: “Corneliu, tsenturionlu, easti om ndreptu sh-ari fricã di Dumnidzãlu. Trã nãsu zburashti ghini tutã fara a Iudeilor. Un anghil sãmtu lj-dzãsi s-ti acljeamã la casa a lui shi s-avdã tsi ai s-lji dzãts a lui.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Atumtsea Petrul lji acljimã s-intra shi s-sheadã tu atsea casã. Tu alantã dzuã Petru s-dusi cu nãshi sh-niscãntsã di fratslji pistimenji di Ioppa lu sotsãsirã.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrul la Casa a Cornelui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Unã dzuã ma nãpoi agiumsirã tu Cesarea. Corneliu ma ashtipta sh-avea acljimatã aproapilji sh-oaspilji a lui scunchi. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Cãndu intrã Petrul, Corneliu lj-ishi nãinti sh-lji cãdzu la cicioari tra s-lu adora. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ma Petrul lu sculã shi lj-dzãsi: “Scoalã-ti! Sh-mini om escu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Cãndu ma grea cu Corneliu, Petrul intrã nãuntru sh-aflã multsã oaminji adunats. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Atumtsea lã dzãsi: “Voi shtits cã trã un Iudeu easti contra a legiljei si sotsãseascã icã s-intrã tu casa a unui xen. Ma Dumnidzãlu mi-ari nvitsat tra s-nu lj-dzãc a vãrui om nicurat icã lãvushit. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Trã atsea vinj fãrã ncuntrari cãndu pitricut oaminji s-nji greascã. Tora ma vã ntreb, cãtse mi acljimatã?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Corneliu apãndisi: “Patru dzãli ma nãinti, tamam tu aestã oara, tu oara trei cãndu ma mi rugam tu casa a mea, ni-ashtiptat s-fãnirusi nãintea a mea un om nviscut cu stranji lunjinoasi. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Elu nj-dzãsi: ‘Cornel! Dumnidzãlu u ari ascultatã rugãciunea a ta, tutashã sh-dicunjili a tali s-adusirã a minti nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Trã atsea, pitreats oaminji tu Ioppa sh-caftã Simonul tsi s-acljeamã Petru. Elu easti tu casa al Simon tãbãcarlu ningã amari.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Atumtsea mini trãoarã pitricui oaminji la tini sh-tini fãtsesh ghini tsi vinish. Tora noi him tuts nãintea a Dumnidzãlui tra s-avdzãm tuti atseali tsi Dumnidzãlu ts-ari ursit.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Atumtsea Petru apãrnji s-greascã: “Dealihea ma aduchescu cã Dumnidzãlu nu tsãni om cu hãtãri.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deut 10:17</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Caitsido di tuti fãrili tsi ari fricã Dumnidzãlu sh-fatsi atsea tsi easti ndreptu, easti ghini-ashtiptat di Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Voi lu cunushtets zborlu tsi Dumnidzãlu lj-ari dat a popului al Israel, predicãnda evanghelu a paciljei prit Isus Hristos. Elu easti Domnul a tutulor. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Voi shtits cã tsi undzi tu tutã Iudea, apãrnjinda di Galilea, dupã pitedzlu tsi dimãndã Ioanul. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Voi shtits cum Dumnidzãlu ari aumtã Isusul di Nazaret cu Duhlu Sãmtu sh-cu puteari, cai tricu tut loclu fãcãnda ghini sh-vindicãnda tuts atselji cai eara putut di draclu, cã Dumnidzãlu eara cu nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Noi him martiri trã tuti lucrili tsi featsi elu tu Iudea sh-tu Ierusalem. Elji lu vãtãmarã spindzurãnda pri lemnul a crutsiljei, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />ma tu dzua a treia Dumnidzãlu lu nyie dit mortsã sh-lu featsi tsi s-hibã vidzut, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />nu tu tut populu, ma la noi, cai earam alepts di Dumnidzãlu ca martir tsi mãcãm sh-bium cu nãsu dupã tsi s-nyie dit mortsã. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Isusul nã ursi s-predicãm a popului shi s-mãrtirsim cã Dumnidzãlu ari bãgat atsel ca giudicãtor a yiilor sh-a mortsãlor. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Tuts prufitsilji mãrtirsescu trã nãsu sh-dzãcã cã caitsido tsi pistipseashti la nãsu ljea ljirtarea a amãrtiilor prit numa a lui.” <verse eid="ACT 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Iarã Petrul ma grea ninga, Duhlu Sãmtu dipunã pristi tuts atselji tsi lu asculta. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Pistimenjlji anvãrliga-tãljeats cai avea vinit cu Petrul s-ciudisirã cã doara a Duhlui Sãmtu s-virsã sh-pristi pãngãnjlji, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />sh-lji avdza grãinda tu alti limbi sh-multumãrirã Dumnidzãlu. Atumtsea Petrul dzãsi: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Poati vãrã s-dãnãseascã apa, tsi nu s-pãteadzã aeshti cai loarã Duhlu Sãmtu ashã di cum sh-noi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Deapoea lã ursi s-pãteadzã tu numa al Isus Hristos. Atumtsea elji lj-cãftarã a Petrului tsi s-armãnea ninga niscãnti dzãli.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Zborlu al Petru trã Predicarea la Pãngãnjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Apostulji sh-fratslji cai eara iutsido tu Iudea avdzãrã cã sh-pãngãnjlji avea aprucheatã zborlu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Cãndu Petrul s-dusi tu Ierusalem pistimenjlji anvãrliga-tãljeats lu ambulisirã cu zboari, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />sh-lji dzãsirã: “Tini intrashi tu casa a nianvãrliga-tãljeatslor sh-mãcash cu nãshi!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Atumtsea Petrul apãrnji s-lã spunã cu aradã a lor tsi avea undzit dzãcãnda: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Earam tu cãsãbãlu di Ioppa sh-ma mi rugam, deapoea vidzui tu extazã unã viziuni, unã tsiva ca pãndzã mari acãtsat dit patruli pãrtsi cai dipunã dit tser sh-vini la mini. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Cãndu u-vidzui di aproapi, bãgai oarã nimalji cu patru-cicioari a loclui, agrimi, azvãrnitori sh-puljilji a tserlui. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Atumtsea avdzãi unã boatsi cai nji dzãsi: ‘Scoalã-ti, Petro. Talji-li sh-mãcã!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Mini lj-dzãsh: ‘Vãrãoarã, Doamne! Cã nu ari intratã vãrãoarã tu gura a mea tsiva lãvushitã icã nicuratã.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Deapoea boatsea dit tser nji dzãsi di a doaua oarã: ‘Nu acljeamã nicurat atsea tsi Dumnidzãu u acljeami curat!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Aestu lucru s-featsi di trei ori, deapoea tuti s-anãltsarã nãpoi tu tser. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Tu oara atsea, trei bãrbats pitricuts la mini di Cesarea, vinirã la casa iu earam noi. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Duhlu nj-dzãsi s-njidzeam cu elji fãrã minduiri. Cu mini vinirã sh-aeshti shasi frats sh-intrãm tu casa atsilui bãrbat. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Elu nã aspusi cã avea vidzut un anghil cai lji si fãnirusi la casa a lui sh-lj-avea dzãsã: ‘Pitreats oaminji tu Ioppa tra s-lji greascã al Simon tsi lji dzãc sh-Petru. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Elu va ts-zburãscã zboari cu cai va s-ascachi tini sh-casa a ta.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Cãndu mini apãrnjii si zburãscu, Duhlu Sãmtu dipunã pri nãshi, ashã cum avea dipunat ma nãinti pri noi. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Atumtsea nj-adush aminti zborlu a Domnului cai dzãsi: ‘Ioanul pãtidzã cu apã, iarã voi va vã pãtidzats cu Duhlu Sãmtu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Macã Dumnidzãlu lã deadi atsilor idyia doarã tsi nã deadi sh-a noauã cai pistipsim la Domnul Isus Hristos, cai earam mini tra s-ncuntram Dumnidzãlu?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Cãndu li avdzãrã aesti zboari, elji s-acumtinarã sh-alãvdarã Dumnidzãlu dzãcãnda: “Dumnidzãlu lã-u deadi sh-a pãngãnjilor mitãnjiusirea cai dutsi tu bana.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisearica tu Antiochia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Atselji cai eara arãspãndits di itia a priaĝuniriljei cai apãrnji dupã moartea al Stefan s-dusirã pãnã tu Fenichia, tu Chipro sh-Antiochia, ma nu dimãndarã zborlu a vãrui dicãt mash a Iudeilor.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Fap 8:1-4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Namisa di nãshi eara sh-niscãntsã bãrbats di Chipro sh-di Tsirenea, cai cala cãtrã Antiochia dimãndarã evanghelu trã Domnul Isus sh-trã pãngãnjlji cai zbura gãrtseashti. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Mãna a Domnului eara cu nãshi sh-un numir mari pistipsirã shi s-turnarã la Domnul. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Shtirea ti aestã agiumsi tu urecljili a bisearicãljei tu Ierusalem, sh-elji pitricurã Barnaba s-njidzea tu Antiochia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Cãndu elu agiumsi aclo sh-vidzu harul a Dumnidzãlui, s-hãrsi sh-lã deadi curaiu a tutulor s-armãnea pistimenji tu Domnul cu tutã inimã. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnaba eara un om bun, umplut di Duhlu Sãmtu sh-di pisti. Ashãtsi un numir mari di oaminji lji si adãvgarã a Domnului. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Deapoea Barnaba s-dusi tu Tarsu s-cãfta Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Cãndu lu aflã, lu adusi tu Antiochia. Elji stãturã atsia un an ntreg la bisearicã shi nvitsarã multsã oaminji. Tu Antiochia ucenitsilji s-acljimarã Crishtinji di prota oarã. <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Tu atseali dzãli, tu Antiochia vinirã nghios niscãntsã prufits di Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Unlu di nãshi cai s-acljima Agab, si sculã sh-prispusi prit Duhlu cã va yinea unã foami mari tu tutã lumea. Aestã undzi tu chirolu cãndu imperator eara Claudiu. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji apofãsirã cã caitsido di elji, dupã putearea tsi avea, s-dãdea tsiva trã agiutari fratslji cai bãna tu Iudea. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Sh-ashãtsi featsirã, pitricãnda a aushlor agiutãrili cu mãna al Barnaba sh-al Saul.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ascãparea Thãvmãtisitã al Petru di Hapsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Tu atsel chiro amirãlu Herod apãrnji s-priaĝuneascã niscãntsã di pistimenjlji a biseritslor. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Elu lu vãtãmã cu spatã Iacovul, fratili al Ioan. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Cãndu vidzu cã aestã lj-arsi a Iudeilor, ursi s-acãtsa sh-Petrul. Eara dzãlili a Adzãmilor. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Dupã tsi lu acãtsã, Ierodul lu bãgã tu hapsi sh-lu prideadi la patru grupi cu patru suldats tsi s-lu vigljea. Elu vrea tsi dupã Pashti s-lu scutea nãintea a popului trã giudicari. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Cãndu Petrul eara tu hapsi, bisearica lji si ruga a Dumnidzãlui cu tutã inimã trã nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Noaptea, nãinti tsi Herodul s-lu scutea Petrul nãintea a popului, elu era ligat cu doi singiri sh-ma durnjea tu mesea di doi suldats, iarã vigljitorlji nãintea a poartãljei vigljea hapsea. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Niashtiptat, s-fãnirusi un anghil a Domnului sh-chilia s-lunjinã di unã lunjinã. Anghilu lu-acãtsã Petrul di coastã sh-lji dzãsi: “Scoalã-ti trãoarã!” Atumtsea singirili lj-cãdzurã di mãnji. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Deapoea anghilu lj-dzãsi: “Bagã curaua sh-leagã sandalili.” Petrul ashã featsi. Dupã aestã lj-dzãsi: “Nveashti mantilul sh-urmeadzã-mi!” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petrul ishi shi s-dusi dupã nãsu, nishtinda cã atsea tsi ma lj-undzea cu anghilu eara dealihea. Elu minduea ca ma videa unã viziuni. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Cãndu tricurã protlu vigljitor sh-a doilu, agiumsirã la poarta di her, tsi ti dutsea tu cãsãbã. Ea s-discljisi singur. Elji ishirã sh-pitrumsirã unã cali, ma niashtiptatã anghilu s-dipãrtã di la nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Atumtsea Petrul aduchi sh-dzãsi: “Tora shtiu dealihea cã Domnul pitricu anghilu a lui sh-mi ascapã di mãnjili al Herod sh-di tuti tsi Iudeilji nãdãea s-nji undzea.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Cum u-aduchi aestã, s-dusi la casa ali Marii, muma al Ioan, tsi s-acljima sh-Marcu. Aclo eara adunat multsã trã rugari. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petrul asunã la poarta di-nafoarã. Unã huzmichearã cu numa Roda vini la poartã s-videa. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Cãndu avdzã boatsea al Petru, ea s-hãrsi ahãntu multu, cãt andi s-discljidea poarta s-dusi trãoarã nãuntru sh-hãbãrsi cã Petrul eara nãintea a poartãljei. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Elji lj-dzãsira: “Tini nu eshti ghini.” Ma ea ipiminisi cã eara dealihea. Atumtsea elji dzãsirã: “Easti anghilu a lui.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Petrul asuna dipriunã la poartã. Cãndu discljisirã poarta, elji lu vidzurã shi s-ciudisirã. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Elu lã-u featsi cu mãna s-tãtsea sh-lã spusi cã cum Domnul lu scoasi di hapsi. Atumtsea dzãsi: “Spunets-u aestã al Iacov sh-a alãntor frats.” Deapoea ishi sh-fudzi tu un loc altu. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Cãndu alghi dzua, s-featsi unã tulburari mari namisa di suldatslji, trã atsea cã, tsi lji avea undzit al Petru. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herodul lu cãftã iutsido, ma nu lu aflã. Atumtsea ntribã vigljitorlji sh-ordinã s-lji vãtãma. Deapoea dipunã di Iudea tu Cesarea sh-dãnãsi aclo.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moartea al Herod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Herod eara multu nãrãit cu locuitorlji al Tiro sh-al Sidon. Atumtsea elji cãdzurã tu uidii shi s-dusirã la nãsu. Deapoea elji lj-umplurã mintea al Blastlu, servitorlu pistimen a amirãlui, sh-cãftarã s-puituea, cã loclu a lor u loa hranea dit amirãriljea a lui. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Tu dzua atsea arãdãpsitã, Herodul avea nviscut stranjili amirãrescu, s-apunã tu thronlu sh-lã zbura. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Populu adunat apãrnji s-aurla: “Atsea easti boatsi di dumnidzã sh-nu di om!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Sh-dinãoarã un anghil a Dumnidzãlui lu agudi Herodul, cã elu nu lj-deadi mãriri a Dumnidzãlui. Elu lu mãcarã yernjili sh-muri. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ma zborlu a Dumnidzãlui s-arãspãndea ma multu shi s-multsea.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pitritsearea al Barnaba sh-al Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Cãndu Barnaba sh-Saulu avea bitisitã misionlu a lor shi s-turnarã tu Ierusalem, loarã cu nãshi Ioanul, acljimat Marcu.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Tora tu bisearica di Antiochi eara prufits shi nvitsãtori: Barnaba, Simeon acljimat Nigheru, Lutsiu di Cirena, Manaenu (tsi eara criscut cu Herod tetrarclu) shi Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Cãndu elji ma alãvda Dumnidzãlu sh-tsãnea pãreasinji, Duhlu Sãmtu lã dzãsi: “Dipãrtsats Barnaba sh-Saulu ti lucrul tsi lji am acljimat.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Atumtsea elji tsãnurã pãreasinji shi s-rugarã, bãgãnda mãnjili pri nãshi sh-lji pitricurã.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tu Chipro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Di doi atselji, pitricuts di la Duhlu Sãmtu, s-dusirã nghios tu Seleutsia sh-di aclo prit amari tu Chipro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Cãndu elji agiumsirã Salamina, predicarã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui tu sinagodzãli a Iudeilor sh-Ioanul eara cu nãshi ca agiutor. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Elji imnarã pristi tutã insula pãnã tu Pafos. Aclo elji adunarã un mãyistru Iudeu, prufit arãdios cu numa Bar-Isus, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />tsi eara cu proconsulu Sergiu Pavlu, un om mintimen. Elu acljimã Barnaba sh-Saulu sh-lã cãftã tra s-avdza zborlu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ma mãyistru, Elimas, cã ashã s-tradutsea numa a lui, lji ncuntra atselji cãftãnda s-lu dipãrta proconsul di pisti. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Atumtsea Saulu, cai s-acljima sh-Pavlu, umplut cu Duhlu Sãmtu, arcã ocljilji pri nãsu, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />shi lj-dzãsi: “Tini, hiljilu al draclu, dushman cu itsido ndriptati, umplut cu tuti soili di arãdeari sh-di ilei, nu va s-muts mãna di strãmbari calea atsea ndreapta al Domnu? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Ia tora, mãna a Domnului easti contra tini. Va s-cheri videarea sh-nu va s-vedz soarili di putsãn chiro.” Trãoarã lu anvãli un negru sh-scutidlu sh-yinea anvãrliga, cãftãnda vãrã tra s-lu tsãnea di mãnã. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Cãndu proconsul lu vidzu cã tsi undzi, sh-elu pistipsi, cã eara ciudisit di nvitsãtura trã Domnul.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Atumtsea Pavlu sh-atselji cai eara cu nãsu s-nchisirã prit amari di Pafos sh-agiumsirã pãnã tu Perga di Pamfilia, iarã Ioanul s-dipãrtã di elji shi s-turnã tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Elji alãsãnda Perga agiumsirã tu Antiochia a Pisidiiljei. Sãmbãta elji intrarã tu sinagogã shi shidzurã. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Dupã cãntarea a Legiljei sh-a Prufitsilor, mãrlji a sinagogãljei pitricurã a lor un om sh-lã dzãsi: “Frats, macã avets vãrã zbor ti inimusirea a popului, ursits sh-dzãtsets-lji.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Atumtsea, Pavlu si-sculã, featsi un semnu cu mãna sh-dzãsi: “Bãrbats Israelits sh-voi, tsi avets fricã di Dumnidzãlu, bãgats oarã! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Dumnidzãlu a popului al Israel aleapsi pãrintsãlji a noshtri sh-featsi un popul mari cãndu elji eara xenji tu loclu al Eghyptu. Elu lã scoasi di aclo cu bratslu a lui vãrtos, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />shi di un chiro di patrudzãtsi di anji, elu li arãvdã tu irnjii. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Shi cum asparsi shapti natsiuni tu loclu a lui acljimat Canaan, lã-u deadi a lor atsel loc ca mushtiniri. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Tut atsea undzi di patru suti tsindzãtsi di anji. Dupã atsea Dumnidzãlu lã deadi giudicãtori pãnã la chirolu a prufitlui Samuel. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Atumtsea populu cãfta s-avea un amirã sh-Dumnidzãlu lã deadi Saulu, hiljilu al Chish, un om di fara al Beniamin, tsi domnui di patrudzãtsi di anji. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Dupã tsi lu mutã Saulu, elu featsi Davidul amirãlu a lor. Dumnidzãlu mãrtirisi ti nãsu: ‘Mini aflai Davidul, hiljilu al Iessi, un bãrbat cu inima ca a mea. Elu va s-facã itsido tsi mini voi.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Dumnidzãlu cum lj-avea tãxitã, prit fara atsilui om lj-adusi al Israel Ascãpãtorlu Isus. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Nãinti tsi s-yinea Isusul, Ioanul predicã a tut popului al Israel trã mitãnjiusiri sh-pãtidzari. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Cãndu eara tu bitisita a misionlui, Ioanul dzãsi: ‘Cai minduits cã escu mini? Mini nu escu atsel tsi voi ashtiptats. Ma easti atsel tsi yini dupã mini sh-a cui mini nu escu axiu s-lji dizlegã sandalili.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Frats, dupãyinitorlji al Abraham sh-voi pãngãnji tsi avets fricã Dumnidzãlu, hãbarea di aestã ascãpari nã si easti pitricut a noauã. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Bãnãtorlji al Ierusalem sh-mãrlji a lor tsi nu lu cunuscurã Isusul, ma cu munduirea a lui atselji mplinirã zboarili a prufitsilor tsi suntu cãntati cathi Sãmbãtã. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Cu tutã cã nu aflarã cãbati tra s-lu munduea cu moarti, elji lj-cãftarã al Pilat tra s-lu vãtãma. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Cãndu elji mplinirã tuti tsi eara scriatã trã nãsu, lu dipunarã dit lemnul a crutsiljei sh-lu bãgarã tu murmintu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ma Dumnidzãlu lu nyie dit mortsã. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Di multi dzãli elu s-vidzu di atselji tsi avea imnat cu nãsu di Galilea pãnã tu Ierusalem. Tora elji suntu martirlji a lui nãintea a popului. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Noi vã dimãndãm hãbarea atsea buna, tsi eara tãxit a ntãnjilor a noshtri. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Dumnidzãlu aestã u ari mplinit trã noi, cilimenjlji a lor, cu nyearea al Isus. Ashãtsi cum easti scriat la a doilu Psalmu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Tini eshti Hiljilu a meu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">azã mini mi facã Tatãl a tãu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Ps 2:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Dumnidzãlu lu sculã dit mortsã tsi elu s-nu videa aspãrdzearea. Ashã cum Dumnidzãlu ari dzãs:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Mini vã dau a voauã tãxirili atseali sãmti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">sh-ghinicuvãntati tsi lj-am fapt al David.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Sh-trã aestã tu un altu loc easti dzãsã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Tini nu va s-alashi Sãmtulu a tãu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:35">tra s-aspargã.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Ps 16:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Tora cãndu Davidul lj-avea huzmitipsit a nãetiljei al Dumnidzãu tu chirolu a lui, elu muri. Elu s-ngrupã cu pãrintsãlji a lui sh-truplu a lui s-asparsi. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ma atsel tsi Dumnidzãlu lu sculã dit mortsã, nu lu vidzu aspãrdzearea. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Trã atsea, fratsi a melji, mini voi si shtits cã prit Isusul easti hãbãrsit ljirtarea a amãrtiilor, cã voi nu puteat s-vã ndriptats dupã legea al Moisiu. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Trã atsea caitsido tsi pistipseashti, s-ndripteadzã. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Afirits-vã tra s-nu vã undzeascã atsea tsi prufitsilji dzãsirã:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Mutrits voi pizuits,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ciudisits-vã sh-chirets!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Cã mini ma fac tu dzãlili a voastri un lucru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">tsi voi nu va lu pistipsits,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">sh-macã vãrã va vã dzãtsea.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Cãndu Pavlu sh-Barnaba ma ishea nafoarã, oaminjlji ma lj-si ruga tra s-lã zbura trã atseali zboari alantã Sãmbãtã. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Cãndu adunatslji tu sinagogã ma s-dipãrta, multsã di Iudeilji sh-atselji turnats tu Iudaismu urmarã Pavlu sh-Barnaba, cai lã zbura a lor sh-lã dãdea curaiu s-armãnea tu harul a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Tu alantã Sãmbãtã aproapi tut cãsãbãlu s-adunã deadun s-avdza zborlu al Domnu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ma cãndu Iudeilji vidzurã multsãmea, elji si umplurã di zilii shi-apãrnjirã s-ncuntreadzã atseali tsi dzãtsea Pavlu sh-lu ambulisirã. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ma Pavlu sh-Barnaba lã apãndisirã a lor cu curaiu: “Noi vream ma nãinti s-vã dimãndam a voauã zborlu al Dumnidzãu. Metsi voi lu arnisits zborlu sh-nu vã lugursits ca axii trã bana eternã, atumtsea noi ma nã turnãm cãtrã pãngãnjlji. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Trã atsea Domnul nã ursi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Mini vã am faptã voi lunjina a pãngãnjilor,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">tsi voi s-dutsets ascãparea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">pãnã tu mardzina a loclui.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Cãndu pãngãnjlji u avdzãrã aestã, elji s-hãrsirã sh-alãvdarã zborlu al Domnu, sh-tuts atselji cai eara arãdãpsits trã bana eternã, pistipsirã. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ashãtsi zborlu a Domnului s-arãspãndea tu tut loclu. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ma Iudeilji lã pushpura a muljerilor dumnidzãsiti a mãrlor sh-a bãrbatslor tinjisits a cãsãbãlui. Elji apãrnjirã unã priaĝuniri contra al Pavlu sh-al Barnaba sh-lji arcarã nafoarã dit loclu a lor. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Atumtsea elji scuturarã pulbirlu dit cicioari pristi elji shi s-dusirã tu Iconiu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ucenitsilji s-umplurã cu harauã sh-cu Duhlu Sãmtu.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Tu Iconiu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Tu Iconiu Pavlu sh-Barnaba intrarã cum eara adetea tu sinagoga a Iudeilor. Aclo elji zburãrã ahãt ghini cãt unã multsãmi mari cu Iudei sh-pãngãnji pistipsirã. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ma Iudeilji cai nu pistipsirã, elji tulburarã alantsã pãngãnji sh-fãrmãcarã mintili a lor contra a fratsilor a noshtri. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ashãtsi Pavlu sh-Barnaba tricurã multu chiro aclo, spunãnda cu curaiu trã Domnul cai alihipsea zborlu a harului a lui sh-fãcãnda axii atselji trã seamni sh-thavmati. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Populu a cãsãbãlui eara mpãrtsãts, niscãntsã eara cu Iudeilji shi altsãlji cu apostulji. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Atumtsea s-featsi un plan namisa di pãngãnjlji sh-di Iudeilji, deadun cu mãrlji a lor, tra s-lji bãtea shi s-lji agudea cu chetri. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Apostulji loarã di hãbari sh-fudzirã tu cãsãbadzli a Licaoniljei, tu Listra, tu Derbe sh-tu loclu di anvãrliga. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Aclo dipriunã hãbãrsirã evanghelu.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tu Listra sh-tu Derbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Tu Listra shidea mpadi un om sãcat. Elu eara amintat ahtar sh-nu avea imnat pute. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Elu avdzã Pavlu cãndu ma zbura. Pavlu arcã ocljilji pristi nãsu sh-vidzu cã avea pisti trã vindicari <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />shi lj-dzãsi cu boatsi analtã: “Scoal-ti pri cicioari!” Trãoarã atsel om si sculã pri cicioari shi apãrnji s-imnã. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Cãndu multsãmea vidzu Pavlul tsi featsi, elji aurlarã tu limba a lor Licaonã: “Dumnidzadzlji s-featsirã oaminji sh-au dipunat la noi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Elji acljimarã Barnaba Zeus sh-Pavlu Hermes, cã elu eara atsel tsi tsãnea zborlu. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Atumtsea preftul al Zeus, tsi templu a lui eara nafoarã dit cãsãbã, adusi dãmalji sh-curunji la portsãli a cãsãbãlui. Elu sh-multsãmea vrea s-fãtsea curbãnji a lor. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ma cãndu apostulji Barnaba sh-Pavlu avdzãrã aestã, elji arupsirã stranjili a lor sh-si sãlãghirã cãtrã multsãmea, aurlãnda: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Bãrbats, cãtse ma u fãtsets aestã? Noi him oaminji ca voi. Noi vã adutsem hãbarea atsea buna, dzãcãnda a voauã s-vã turnats di la lucrili atseali goali, la Dumnidzãlu atsel yiulu, cai adrã tserlu sh-loclu, amarea sh-tuti cai suntu tu nãshi. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Tu chirolu tricut, elu alãsã natsiunili tra s-njidzea pri cãljurili a lor. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Cu tut atsea, elu nu nã alãsa noi fãrã mãrtirii: Elu vã ari spusã bunãtati dãnda a voauã ploai dit tser sh-biricheti tu chirolu a lor. Elu nã da multã hranã sh-vã umplu ininjli a voastri cu harauã.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Cu tutã cã, li dzãsirã aesti zboari, elji avea mari zori s-tsãnea multsãmea trã fãtseari curbani a lor. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Atumtsea niscãntsã Iudei cai vinirã dit Antiochia sh-Iconiu lji umplurã mintea ali multsãmi sh-agudirã cu chetsri pri Pavlu sh-lu trapsirã nafoarã di cãsãbã, minduinda cã avea murit. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Cãndu ucenitsilji s-adunarã anvãrliga di nãsu, elu si sculã shi intrã tu cãsãbã. Tu alantã dzuã elu sh-Barnaba fudzirã tu Derbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Turnarea tu Antiochia al Sirii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Elji predicarã evanghelu tu atsel cãsãbã shi amintarã un numir mari di ucenitsi. Atumtsea s-turnarã tu Listra, Iconiu sh-Antiochia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Elji nvãrtushirã suflitli a ucenitsilor sh-lã deadirã curaiu tra s-armãnã alihioshi tu pisti. “Noi prindi s-tritsem namisa di multi munduiri tra s-intrãm tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui,” dzãtsea elji. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Tu cathi bisearicã Pavlu sh-Barnaba aleapsirã aushlji cu rugãciunji sh-pãreasinji, lji-u deadirã a Domnului, la cai avea pistipsitã. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Elji tricurã prit Pisidia sh-agiumsirã tu Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Cãndu avea predicat zborlu tu Perga, elji dipusirã tu Attalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Dupã Attalia elji fudzirã prit amari tu Antiochia, di iu era nchisitã cu harul al Dumnidzãu ti lucrul tsi tora elji avea bitisit. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Cãndu agiumsirã aclo, adunarã bisearica sh-aspusirã itsido tsi Dumnidzãlu avea faptã prit nãshi sh-cum avea discljis ushili a pistiljei la pãngãnjlji. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Pavlu sh-Barnaba stãturã aclo cu ucenitsilji di multu chiro.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Consiliul al Ierusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Niscãntsã oaminji vinirã di Iudea tu Antiochia shi lji nvitsa ucenitsilji ashãtsi: “Macã nu vã anvãrliga-tãljeats dupã legea tsi nã nvitsã Moisiul, voi nu putets s-ascãpats.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Atumtsea Pavlu sh-Barnaba avurã ngrãnji sh-debati cu nãshi. Ashã elji apofãsirã tsi Pavlu sh-Barnaba sh-deadun cu niscãntsã ucenitsi, s-alina tu Ierusalem s-aduna cu apostulji sh-aushlji trã aestã niachicãsiri. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Bisearica lji nchisi di cali sh-elji tricurã namisa di Fenichia sh-Samaria shi elji spusirã cum pãngãnjlji eara turnats. Atsea hãbari lji hãrsi multã fratslji. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Cãndu elji agiumsirã tu Ierusalem, s-ghini-ashtiptarã di bisearica, di apostulji sh-aushlji. Elji spusirã itsido tsi Dumnidzãlu avea faptã prit nãshi. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Atumtsea niscãntsã di ucenitsilji di partea a Fariseilor si scularã sh-dzãsirã: “Pãngãnjlji prindi s-hibã anvãrliga-tãljeats sh-lipseashti s-veaglji legea al Moisiu.” <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Apostulji sh-aushlji s-adunarã tra s-mutrea cu cãshtigã aestu lucru. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Dupã multã cuvendzi, Petrul si sculã sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Frats, voi shtits cã putsãn chiro ma nãinti Dumnidzãlu mi aleapsi mini namisa di voi tsi pãngãnjlji s-avdza prit gura a mea zborlu al evanghelu shi s-pistipsea. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Dumnidzãlu, cai cunoashti ininjli, nji spusi cã elu lji apruche sh-lã deadi Duhlu Sãmtu atsilor, ashã cum featsi sh-cu noi. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Elu nu tsãni cu hãtãri namisa di noi sh-di elji, cã elu ari curatã ininjli a lor prit pisti. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Atumtsea, cãtse voi lu bãgats tu cãrteari Dumnidzãlu bãgãnda pri zverca a pãngãnjilor un giug tsi nu lu tsãnum nitsi noi sh-nitsi pãrintsãlji a noshtri? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Nu! Noi pistipsim cã prit harul a Domnului Isus noi him ascãpats, ashã cum suntu sh-elji.” <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Tutã multsãmea tãcu sh-asculta Barnaba sh-Pavlu spunãnda trã seamnili sh-thavmatili tsi Dumnidzãlu avea faptã la pãngãnjlji prit elji. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Cãndu elji bitisirã cuvenda, Iacovul dzãsi: “Frats, ascultats-mi. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simonul nã spusi cã cum di prota oarã Dumnidzãlu aleapsi un popul trã numa a lui di pãngãnjlji. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Zboarili a prufitsilor suntu uidisiti dupã cum easti scriatã:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Dupã aestã mini va mi tornu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">shi va s-ndregã tenda cãdzutã al David.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Surpãturili iarã va li adar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">sh-va u analtsã,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />ashãtsi tuts oaminjlji s-caftã Domnul,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">sh-tuts pãngãnjlji va s-acljeamã numa a mea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">dzãtsi Domnul cai li fatsi atseli lucri<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />cunuscuti di tu eta a etilor.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Trã atsea, minduiescu s-nu lji tulburãm pãngãnjlji tsi suntu turnat la Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ma prindi sã scriem unã carti a lor dzãcãnda tra s-dipãrteadzã di hranea lãvushitã a idoljilor, di putãnsirea, di carnea a nimaljilor supsiti sh-di sãndzili. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Cã legea al Moisiu easti predicat tu cathi cãsãbã dit chirolu di ma nãinti sh-easti cãntat tu sinagodzãli cathi Sãmbãtã.” <verse eid="ACT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Atumtsea, apostulji sh-aushlji deadun cu tutã bisearica, apofãsirã s-aleagã niscãntsã di oaminjlji a lor shi s-lji pitreacã tu Antiochi cu Pavlu sh-Barnaba. Elji aleapsirã Iuda, acljimat Barsaba sh-Sila, bãrbats frãmtashi namisa di pistimenjlji. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Elji pitricurã aestã carti cu nãshi:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="ACT 15:23">Apostulji sh-aushlji, fratslji a voshtri, a pãngãnjilor pistimenji tu Antiochia, tu Siria sh-tu Chilichia, sãnãtati!<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Noi avem avdzãtã cã vinirã niscãntsã di noi fãrã autorizarea a noastrã sh-tulburarã mintili a voastri cu atseali tsi dzãsirã. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Noi avem apofãsit tuts pi unã minti sh-aleapsim niscãntsã bãrbats sh-lji pitricum la voi cu sotslji a noshtri vruts Barnaba sh-Pavlu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />cai au bãgat bana a lor tu piricljiu ti numa a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Trã atsea, noi ma pitritsem Iuda sh-Sila tra s-vã spunã a voauã cu gura a lor atseali tsi noi avem scriat. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Lji si pãru ghini a Duhlui Sãmtu sh-a noauã s-nu vã ngãrcãm cu tsiva ma multu dicãt atseali dimãndari lipsiti: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />s-vã dipãrtats di hranea curbãnsitã a idoljilor, di sãndzili, di carnea a nimaljilor supsiti sh-di putãnsirea. Voi va fãtsets ghini s-vã afirits di aesti lucri.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="ACT 15:29">S-hits ghini!<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ashãtsi, elji s-pitricurã shi-s-dusirã tu Antiochia, adunarã tuts ucenitsilji sh-lã deadirã cartea. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Cãndu elji cãntarã cartea, s-hãrsirã di inimusirea tsi loarã. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Atumtsea Iuda sh-Sila, cai eara prufitsi, tsãnurã un zbor lungu sh-deadirã inimã a fratsilor sh-lji nvãrtushirã. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Stãnda putsãn chiro atsia, s-nchisirã tu pace di fratslji la atselji cai lji avea pitricut. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Iarã al Sila lji pãru ghini s-armãnea aclo.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu versu nu s-aflã tu niscãnti veaclji manuscrisi.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Pavlu sh-Barnaba armasirã tu Antiochia, iu elji sh-multsã altsã nvitsa sh-dimãnda zborlu a Domnului.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu sh-Barnaba s-Dipartu di Un-alantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Dupã niscãnti dzãli Pavlu lj-dzãsi al Barnaba: “S-nã turnãm shi s-adunãm fratslji tu tuti cãsãbadzli iu avem predicat zborlu a Dumnidzãlui shi s-lji videm cum suntu.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaba vrea s-loa cu nãsu sh-Ioanul, tsi s-acljima Marcu. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Iarã Pavlu ipiminisi tra s-nu loa cu nãshi atsel cai eara dipãrtsat di nãshi tu Pamfilia, sh-nu eara dus cu nãshi tu lucrul al Domnu. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Elji si ngrãnjirã ntrã nãshi ahãntu multu cãt s-dipãrtsarã di un-alantu. Barnaba lo Marcul sh-nãftãsi cãtrã Chipro. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Pavlu aleapsi Sila shi s-nchisi dupã tsi fratslji lji-l-pistipsirã a harului al Domnu. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Elu s-dusi cãtrã Siria sh-Chilichia nvãrtushãnda biseritsli.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu sh-Sila Loarã Timoteul tu Huzmitipsiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pavlu agiumsi tu Derbe sh-deapoea sh-tu Listra. Aclo bãna un ucenic cu numa Timote. Muma a lui eara pistimenã uvreauã sh-tatã-su elin. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Trã nãsu zbura ghini fratslji tu Listra sh-tu Iconiu. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pavlu vrea tsi Timoteu s-njidzea dupã nãsu, trã atsea lu anvãrliga-tãlje trã itia a Iudeilor cai bãna tu atseali locuri, cã tuts shtia cã tatãl a lui eara elin. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Cãndu s-dutsea dit un cãsãbã tu alantu hãbãrsea oaminjlji trã apofãsirili tsi avea loatã apostulji sh-aushlji di Ierusalem tsi s-li fãtsea. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ashãtsi biseritsli si nvãrtushea tu pisti shi crishtea tu numir dzuã dupã dzuã.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Viziunea al Pavlu cu Un Om di Machidunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pavlu shi atselji tsi cãlãtorea cu nãsu tricurã namisa di locurili a Frighiiljei sh-a Galatiiljei, sh-Duhlu Sãmtu lji tsãnu s-nu predica zborlu tu Asia atsea njica. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Cãndu elji vinirã la sinurlu di Misia, vrurã s-intra tu Bitinia, ma Duhlu al Isus nu lji alãsã. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ashãtsi elji tricurã prit Misia shi s-dusirã pãnã tu Troas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Noaptea Pavlu avu un viziuni a unui om di Machidunia cai stãtea nãintea a lui shi lji si ruga: “Haidi la noi tu Machidunii s-nã agiuts.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Dupã tsi Pavlu vidzu viziunea, noi nã etimãsim trãoarã tra s-njidzem tu Machidunii, cãndãrsits tsi Dumnidzãlu nã avea acljimat s-predicam a lor evanghelu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidia di Filipia Pistipsi la Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Trã atsea noi nãftãnda di Troada nã dusim tu Samotrachia sh-alantã dzuã tu Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Di aclo noi agiumsim tu Filipii, cai eara protlu cãsãbã sh-colonii romanã tu loclu di Machidunii. Shi noi stãtum aclo niscãnti dzãli. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Tu dzua di Sãmbãtã noi ishim nafoarã di poarta a cãsãbãlui mardzina di arãu, sh-vream s-aflam un loc trã rugãciuni. Noi shidzum mpadi shi apãrnjim si zburam a muljerilor cai eara adunati aclo. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Unã di atseali tsi ma nã asculta eara unã muljeari cu numa Lidia di Tiatira, unã vinditoarã di purpurã. Ea eara unã alãvdãtoarã a Dumnidzãlui. Domnul lj-discljisi inima a ljei tra s-asculta zborlu al Pavlu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Cãndu ea sh-atselji di casa a ljei s-pãtidzarã, ea nã acljimã la casã. “Macã voi mi lugursits pistimenã a Domnului,” dzãsi ea, “intrats shi shidets la casa a mea.” Ea ipiminisi s-njidzeam la casa a ljei.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu sh-Sila Hãpsãnit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Unã oarã cãndu ma njidzeam la loclu a rugãciuniljei, adunãm unã featã sclavã cai avea un duh arãu tsi prividea yinitura. Ea adutsea multu amintatic a nicuchirilor cu prividearili a ljei. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ea njidzea dupã Pavlu sh-dupã noi, aurlãnda: “Aeshti bãrbats suntu huzmichearlji a Dumnidzãlui, Atsel Analtu, tsi vã spuni a voauã calea di ascãpari.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Sh-ea u featsi aestã di multi dzãli. Ma Pavlu lji si turnã nãrãit sh-lji dzãsi a duhlui: “Tu numa al Isus Hristos ti ursescu tsi s-eshi nafoarã dit ea!” Tu atsea oarã duhlu u alãsã. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Cãndu nicuchirlji achicãsirã cã nãdia a lor trã amintatic chiru, elji acãtsarã Pavlu sh-Sila shi lji trapsirã cãtrã pãzari tra s-isha nãintea a autoritãtsilor. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Cãndu lji dusirã nãintea a autoritãtsilor, lã dzãsirã: “Aeshti bãrbats ma tulburã cãsãbãlu a nostru. Elji suntu uvrei. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Elji nveatsã adetsi trã noi, cai noi Romanji nu li urmãm sh-nu li fãtsem.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Multsãmea si sculã contra al Pavlu sh-al Sila, sh-autoritãtsili ursirã tra s-lã arupã stranjili a lor shi s-lji bãtea cu ciumãdzi. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Dupã tsi lji bãturã multu arãu, lji bãgarã tu hapsi, sh-ursirã vigljitorlu s-lji vigljea ghini. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Cãndu elu lo ahtãri ordini, lji bãgã tu chilii hãndoasã sh-lã ligã cicioarili tu giuglu di lemn. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Tu njeadzã-noapti Pavlu sh-Sila ma s-ruga sh-ma cãnta imnuri a Dumnidzãlui sh-alantsã hãpsãnit ma avdza. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Niashtiptat s-featsi un mari cutrembur sh-thimeljiurili a hapsiljei s-trunduirã. Trãoarã tuti ushili s-discljisirã sh-a cuitsido lji si dizligarã prãnghili. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Anda vigljitorlu si-sculã sh-vidzu ushili discljisi, elu lo spata sh-vrea si s-vãtãma minduinda cã hãpsãnitslji avea ascãpat. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Atumtsea Pavlu lj-aurlã cu boatsi analtã: “Nu fã arãutati pri tini! Noi him tuts aoa!” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Vigljitorlu cãftã lunjinã, intrã trãoarã sh-cãdzu trimurãnda nãintea al Pavlu sh-al Sila. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Elu lji scoasi nafoarã sh-lji ntribã: “Domnji, tsi prindi s-facã tra s-ascapã?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Elji apãndisirã: “Pistipsea tu Domnul Isus sh-va s-ascachi, tini sh-tutã soia a ta.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Atumtsea elji lji predicarã a lui zborlu a Domnului sh-a tuts atsilor cai eara la casa a lui. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Tu atsea oarã a noaptiljei vigljitorlu lji lo sh-aspilã pledzili a lor. Atumtsea, elu sh-tutã soia a lui trãoarã s-pãtidzã. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Vigljitorlu lji adusi la casa a lui sh-lã deadi trã mãcari. Elu s-umplu cu harauã cã pistipsi tu Dumnidzã, elu sh-tutã soia a lui. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Cãndu alghi dzua, autoritãtsili pitricurã militarlji a lor s-lji dzãtsea a vigljitorlui: “Sãlãghea atselji bãrbats.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Vigljitorlu lj-dzãsi al Pavlu: “Autoritãtsili au ursit tsi tini sh-Sila s-vã sãlãghits. Ishits sh-fudzits tu pace!” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ma Pavlu lj-dzãsi a militarilor: “Atselji nã bãturã tu padi ni fãrã s-him giudicats, cu tutã cã noi him cãsãbunji romanji, sh-nã bãgarã tu hapsi. Sh-tora vor s-nã dipãrteadzã pri ascumtu? Nu! S-yinã elji shi s-nã sotsãseascã nafoarã.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Sh-militarlji lã pitricurã hãbari a autoritãtsilor. Cãndu elji avdzãrã tsi Pavlu sh-Sila eara cãsãbunji romanji, lji acãtsã unã fricã mari. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Atumtsea elji vinirã sh-cãftarã ljirtari. Dupã tsi lji scoasirã nafoarã, cãftarã s-fugã di cãsãbã. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Cãndu Pavlu sh-Sila ishirã dit hapsi, elji s-dusirã la casa a Lidãljei. Aclo adunarã fratsi sh-surãri, lã inimusirã atselji sh-fudzirã.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Sãruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Dupã tsi Pavlu sh-sotslji a lui avea tricut prit Amfipoli sh-prit Apolonia, agiumsirã Sãruna iu eara sinagoga a Iudeilor. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pavlu, dupã adetea a lui, intrã tu sinagogã sh-di trei Sãmbãti arada cuvinta cu nãshi trã Scriturili, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />dimãndãnda sh-alihipsãnda a lor cã Hristolu prindea s-munduia sh-si nyeadzã dit mortsã, dzãcãnda: “Aestu Isus tsi mini vã dimãndu easti Hristolu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Niscãntsã di elji s-cãndãrsirã shi s-dusirã dupã Pavlu sh-Sila, sh-ashãtsi featsirã un numir mari di elinji tsi avea fricã di Dumnidzãlu sh-niscãnti muljeri avdzãti. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ma altsã Iudei zilipsirã sh-adunarã niscãntsã oaminji anapudzi dit pãzari, scularã unã multsãmi sh-mintirã cãsãbãlu. Ambulisirã casa al Iason sh-cãfta Pavlu sh-Sila tra s-lji scutea nãintea a popului. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Dupã tsi nu lji aflarã, trapsirã azvara Iasonul sh-niscãntsã frats nãintea a mãrlor a cãsãbãlui, aurlãnda: “Atselji, tsi au mintitã tutã lumea, vinirã sh-aoa. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Iasonul lji ghini-ashtiptã aeshti. Tuts aeshti lucreadzã contra a dimãndãrilor a Cesarului, dzãcãnda cã easti un altã amirã, Isusul.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Elji tulburarã populu sh-mãrlji a cãsãbãlui, cai avdzãrã aesti zboari. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Mãrlji a cãsãbãlui, dupã tsi si siguripsirã di Iasonul sh-di altsãlji, lji sãlãghirã. <verse eid="ACT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Atsea noapti fratslji trãoarã nchisirã Pavlu sh-Sila Veria. Macãt agiumsirã aclo, s-dusirã tu sinagoga a Iudeilor. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Aeshti Iudei eara ma tinjisits dicãt atselji di Sãruna sh-lu apruchearã zborlu cu vreari mari. Cathi dzuã sitãxea Scriturili, tra s-videa macã aesti lucri eara di alihea. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Trã atsea multsã di nãshi pistipsirã, deadun cu niscãnti muljeri elini avdzãti, sh-mults bãrbatsi. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ma, cãndu Iudeilji di Sãruna avdzãrã cã Pavlu avea dimãndatã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui sh-tu Veria, vinirã sh-aclo tra s-tulbura shi s-mintea multsãmea. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Atumtsea fratslji sh-surãrili nchisirã trãoarã Pavlul cãtrã amari, iarã Sila sh-Timoteu armasirã aclo. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Atselji tsi sotsãsea Pavlul, lu dusirã pãnã Athina. Deapoea s-turnarã cu dimãndãciunea tsi Sila sh-Timoteul s-njidzea la nãsu cãt ma curundu.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Athina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Iarã Pavlu ma lji ashtipta Athina, s-nvirinã multu, vidzãnda cãsãbãlu mplinã di idolji. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Elu cuvinta tu sinagogã cu Iudeilji sh-cu pãngãnjlji cai avea fricã Dumnidzãlu, sh-cathi dzuã tu pãzari cu atselji cai s-afla aclo. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Niscãntsã filosofi Epicurei shi Stoici zbura cu nãsu. Sh-niscãntsã ntriba: “Tsi dzãtsi aestu dãrdãros?” Sh-alantsãlji dzãtsea: “Aestu nji si pari cã easti dimãndãtor a xenjilor dumnidzadz.” Cã Pavlu ma dimãnda hãbarea atsea buna al Isus sh-nyearea. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Atumtsea luãnda lu dusirã tu Areopag, sh-lu ntribarã: “Putem si shtim tsi easti aestã nvitsãturã noauã di cai tini zburashti? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Nã asunã ca idei ciudioasi ti urecljili a noastri, trã atsea vrem sã shtim tsi vor s-dzãc aesti.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Tuts Athineilji sh-xenjilji cai bãna aclo, tritsea chirolu avdzãnda shi spunãnda vãrã zbor nou. <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Atumtsea Pavlu, stãtu nãintea a Areopaglui sh-dzãsi: “Bãrbats Athinei! Mini ved cã voi hits multu pistimenji tu itsido. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Imnãnda anvãrliga di cãsãbã sh-mutrinda lucrili a voastri atseali sãmti, mini aflai un altar iu eara scriat: ‘A Dumnidzãlui atsilui nicunuscut.’ Atselu tsi voi lu alãvdats fãrã s-lu cunushtets, mini ma vã lu dimãndu. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Dumnidzãlu tsi adãrã lumea sh-itsido tsi esti tu nãsã, easti Domnu a tserlui sh-a loclui sh-nu bãneadzã tu templi adrati di mãnjili a omlui. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Elu nu si huzmitipseashti di mãnjili a oaminjlor, canda s-avea ananghi di tsiva, cã elu lã da a tutulor banã, duh sh-itsido. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Dumnidzãlu ari faptã di un singur om tuti fãrili a oaminjlor, cai s-bãneadzã tu tut loclu, sh-arãdãpsi chirolu sh-sinurli a loclui iu va bãna elji. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Dumnidzãlu vru tsi oaminjlji s-lu caftã shi s-lu aflã, cu tutã cã elu nu easti diparti di cathiunu di noi. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Tu nãsu bãnãm, imnãm sh-existãm, di cum au dzãsã sh-niscãntsã di poetslji a voshtri: ‘Cã sh-noi him cilimenjlji a lui.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Sh-metsi him cilimenjlji a Dumnidzãlui, nu prindi s-minduim cã natura dumnidzeascã easti ca furia sh-ca asimea, icã ca cheatra pilichisitã di masturlji sh-di tehnea a lor. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Dumnidzãlu tsi nu bagã oarã chirolu a nishtiriljei, tora lji ursi tuts oaminjlji iutsido s-mitãnjiuseascã. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Cã elu ari apofãsitã dzuã tu cai va s-giudicã lumea cu ndriptati prit un om cai ari arãdãpsit. Aestã lã u-ari alihipsitã a tutulor cu nyearea a lui dit mortsã.” <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Cãndu avdzãrã di nyearea a mortsãlor, niscãntsã apãrnjirã s-pizueascã, iarã altsã dzãsirã: “Noi va ti ascultãm dinou trã aestã.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ashãtsi Pavlu s-dipãrtã di mesea a lor. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Niscãntsã di elji s-dusirã dupã Pavlu sh-pistipsirã tu Domnul, ntrã atselji eara Dionisul aeropaghitul, unã muljeari tsi s-acljima Damara sh-niscãntsã altsã.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Corintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Dupã aestã Pavlu fudzi di Athina sh-vini Corintu. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Aclo aflã un Iudeu cu numa Acuila, amintat tu Pontu cai macãt avea vinit di Italia cu muljearea a lui Prishila, cã imperatorlu Claudiu avea ursitã tuts Iudeilji s-fudzea di Roma. Pavlu s-dusi la elji. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Cã metsi avea unã zãnati, stãtu sh-lucrã deadun cu nãshi. Tehnea a lor eara s-adra tendi. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Cathi Sãmbãtã Pavlu nvitsa tu sinagogã shi s-cilistisea s-cãndãrsea Iudeilji sh-Elinji. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Cãndu vinirã Sila sh-Timoteu di Machidunii, Pavlu tut chirolu predica zborlu a Dumnidzãlui dimãndãnda a Iudeilor cã Isusul easti Hristolu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ma elji lu ncuntrarã sh-lu pizuirã, atumtsea Pavlu scuturã pulbirlu a stranjilor sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Sãndzili a vostru s-hibã pristi capitli a voastri! Mini nu am cãbati, di tora sh-nclo va mi duc la pãngãnjlji.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Pavlu ishi di sinagogã sh-s-dusi la casa a unui om cu numa Titu Iustu, un alãvdãtor a Dumnidzãlui tsi u avea casa aproapi di sinagoga. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Crispu, marili a sinagogãljei, pistipsi la Domnul deadun cu tutã casa a lui sh-multsã Corintenji, ascultãnda Pavlul pistipsirã shi s-pãtidzarã. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Unã noapti Domnul lji dzãsi al Pavlu tu viziuni: “S-nu ai fricã, ma grea sh-nu tatsi, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />cã mini escu cu tini sh-vãrã nu va bagã mãnã pri tini s-tsã facã arãu. Mini am multu oaminji tu cãsãbãlu aestu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Pavlu stãtu aclo un an shi shasi meshi, nvitsãnda a lor zborlu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Cãndu Galionlu eara proconsul a Ahaiiljei, Iudeilji si scularã deadun contra al Pavlu sh-lu dusirã nãintea a tribunalui, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />dzãcãnda: “Aestu om ma cãndãrseashti oaminjlji s-alavdã Dumnidzãlu contra atsiljei tsi nveatsi legea.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Macãt Pavlu vrea s-grea, Galionu lã dzãsi a Iudeilor: “Ma s-eara zborlu di vãrã nindriptati icã di vãrã arãutati, va s-vã ascultam cu arãvdari trã ntribarea a voastrã. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Metsi easti zborlu trã nvitsãturã, trã numi sh-trã legea a voastrã, mutrits voi, cã mini nu voi s-mi fac giudicãtor ti ahtãri lucri.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Sh-lji scoasi nafoarã di tribunal. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Atumtsea tuts atselji lu acãtsarã Sostenul, marili a sinagogãljei sh-lu bãturã nãintea a tribunalui. Ma Galionlu nu vrea s-shtia dip trã aesti lucri.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Prishila, Acuila sh-Apollo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pavlu armasi tu Corintu di multi dzãli, si salutã cu fratslji sh-surãrili sh-nãftãsi cãtrã Siria deadun cu Prishila sh-Acuila. Pavlu tumsi caplu tu Chencrea, cã avea faptã unã spigiurari. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Cãndu agiumsirã tu Efes, lji alãsã atselji atsia, iarã elu intrã tu sinagogã trã cuvintari cu Iudeilji. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Elji lji fãtsea rigeai s-armãnea ma multu, ma elu nu vru. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Cu tut atsea cãndu ma s-dipãrta di elji lã dzãsi: “Macã easti vrearea a Dumnidzãlui va mi tornu nãpoi la voi.” Deapoea s-dipãrtã dit Efes nãftãnda cu varcã. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Dupã tsi agiumsi tu Cesarea, s-alinã tu Ierusalem, salutã bisearica sh-deapoea dipunã tu Antiochia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Dãnãsi aclo di putsãn chiro, deapoea fudzi shi s-dusi prit locurili a Galatiiljei sh-a Frighiiljei, nvãrtushãnda tuts ucenitsilji. <verse eid="ACT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Tu Efes vini un Iudeu cu numa Apollo, amintat tu Alexandria, un om orator tsi cunushtea ghini Scriturili. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Elu eara nvitsat tu calea a Domnului shi, n-focat tu suflit, grea sh-nvitsa ghini trã Isusul, cu tut cã cunushtea singur pitedzlu al Ioan. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Elu apãrnji si zburãscã discljisã tu sinagogã. Cãndu lu avdzãrã Acuila sh-Prishila, lu loarã dinãparti sh-lji u-sitixirã ma ghini calea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Metsi elu vrea s-njidzea tu Ahaia, fratslji sh-surãrili lji deadirã curaiu sh-lji scriarã a ucenitsilor tra s-lu ashtipta. Cum agiumsi aclo, elu lji agiutã multu atselji cai avea pistipsitã prit harul. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Elu lji ncuntra cu fuchii Iudeilji, aspunãnda discljis prit Scrituri, cã Isusul easti Hristolu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu tu Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Cãndu Apollo eara tu Corintu, Pavlu dupã tsi s-dusi tu locurili di ma nsus, agiumsi tu Efes. Aclo aflã niscãntsã ucenitsi <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />sh-lji ntribã: “Lu avets loatã Duhlu Sãmtu, cãndu avets pistipsitã?” Elji lji dzãsirã: “Noi nu avem avdzãtã dip cã ari Duh Sãmtu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ashãtsi Pavlu lã dzãsi a lor: “Cu tsi vã pãtidzat atumtsea?” Elji lji dzãsirã: “Cu pitedzlu al Ioan.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Atumtsea Pavlul lã dzãsi: “Ioanul pãtidzã cu pitedzlu a mitãnjusiriljei, dzãcãnda a popului s-pistipsea tu atsel tsi va yinea dupã nãsu, tsi easti Isusul.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Sh-elji, cum avdzãrã, s-pãtidzarã tu numa al Domnu Isus. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Cãndu Pavlu bãgã mãna pristi elji, Duhlu Sãmtu dipunã pristi nãshi sh-elji zbura tu alti limbi sh-prufitipsirã. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Atselji eara vãrã doisprãdzatsi di bãrbats. <verse eid="ACT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pavlu intrã tu sinagogã, lã zbura discljis a oaminjlor di trei meshi arada, discutãnda sh-cãndãrsinda atselji ti amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ma, metsi niscãntsã eara cap-groshi sh-nu pistipsea, zbura arãu trã Calea nãintea a multsãmiljei, Pavlu s-dipãrtã di nãshi, lji mpãrtsã ucenitsilji sh-cathi dzuã lji nvitsa tu sculia a unui cu numa Tiran. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Aestã s-lundzi di doi anji, ashã cã tuts bãnãtorlji di Asia, Iudei sh-Elinji lu avdzãrã zborlu a Domnului. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Dumnidzãlu fãtsea thavmati ciudioasi prit mãnjili al Pavlu, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />tsi cãndu adutsea a nipututslor mãndilili sh-stranjili, tsi avea pusputitã truplu al Pavlu, sh-niputerili s-dipãrta di la nãshi sh-duhurili atseali arali ishea di la elji. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Niscãntsã Iudei nomadz exortsishti imnãnda tu multi locuri vrurã s-acljima numa a Domnului Isus pristi atselji tsi avea duhuri arali, dzãcãnda: “Vã ursim pri Isusul, trã cai preadicã Pavlu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Atselji tsi fãtsea aestã eara shapti hiljilji al un arhipreftu Iude cu numa Schevi. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ma duhlu atsel arãulu apãndisi: “Mini l-cunoscu Isusul sh-Pavlu, ma voi cai hits?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Atumtsea atsel om, tsi avea duhlu atsel arãu, s-arcã pristi nãshi sh-cum lji bãtu, lã featsi un ahtari bãteari sh-elji fudzirã di atsea casã dispuljeats sh-pliguits. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Cãndu loarã di hãbari tuts Iudeilji sh-Elinji, tsi bãna tu Efes, tuts lji acãtsã frica sh-numa a Domnului Isus s-multu-mãri. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Sh-multsã di elji, cai avea pistipsitã, yinea mãrtirsinda sh-spunãnda faptili a lor. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Multsã di atselji, tsi s-loa cu mãyii, adusirã cãrtsili a lor sh-li arsirã nãintea a tutulor. Cãndu lugursirã costul a lor, aflarã cã eara tsindzãtsi di njilji di asimi. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ashãtsi zborlu a Domnului s-arãspãndea shi si nvãrtushea ma multu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tulburarea tu Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Dupã aesti tsi undzirã, Pavlu apofãsi s-ducã tu Ierusalem, tricãndã prit Machidunii sh-prit Ahaia, sh-dzãtsea: “Dupã tsi s-hiu aclo, prindi s-ved sh-Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Atumtsea pitricu tu Machidunii doi di atselji tsi lj-agiuta, Timoteu sh-Erastu, sh-elu armasi di putsãn chiro tu Asia. <verse eid="ACT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Sh-tu atsel chiro s-featsi un tulburari mari trã itia a Caliljei. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Un om cu numa Dimitru, asimgi, cai fãtsea tu asimi templi njitsi ali Artemisi, lã adutsea a masturilor multã amintatic. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Elu lji adunã zãnãtceadzlji deadun cu lucrutorlji tsi avea idyia tehni, sh-lã dzãsi: “Bãrbats, voi u shtits cã buneatsa a noastrã yini di aestã tehni. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Voi videts sh-avdzãts cã aestu Pavlu lã ari cãndãrsitã sh-ari alãxitã mintea a mults oaminji nu mash tu Efes, ma aproapi tu tutã Asia, dzãcãnda cã nu suntu dumnidzadz atselji cai suntu faptsã cu mãnjili a oaminjlor. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Trã atsea easti piricljiu nu mash trã noi tsi aestã tehni si s-arucã hima, ma sh-templul a mariljei dumnidzoanji Artemisa si nu s-tinjiseascã nits-niheamã shi s-lji fugã mãriljea atsiljei tsi u tinjiseashti tut Asia sh-tut lumea.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Elji, cãndu li avdzãrã aesti, s-umplurã cu inati sh-aurlarã, dzãcãnda: “Mari easti Artemisa a Efesianjlor!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Tu tutã cãsãbãlu s-featsi unã mintiturã, loarã cu zori Gaiul sh-Aristarcul, Machidunienjlji sotslji al Pavlu, shi-tuts pi un minti s-dusirã cãtrã teatru. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pavlu vrea s-ishea nãintea a popului, ma ucenitsilji nu lu alãsarã. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Niscãntsã di autoritãtsili a loclui, tsi eara oaspits a lui, pitricurã oaminji la nãsu sh-lji featsirã rigeai s-nu dutsea la teatru. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Atumtsea s-featsi unã mintiturã la adunatslji. Niscãntsã aurla sh-dzãtsea unã tsiva, alantsã altã tsiva, ma multsãlji nu shtia cã trã tsi s-adunarã. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Atumtsea dit multsãmea scoasirã nãinti Alexandrul, sh-Iudeilji lji dãdea curaiu s-grea. Alexandrul, cum featsi cu mãna, vrea s-dzãtsea un zbor trã apãrari nãintea a popului. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ma, cãndu lu achicãsirã cã eara Iude, tuts cu unã boatsi, apãrnjirã s-aurla aproapi di doauã ori di chiro: “Mari easti Artemisa a Efesianjlor!” <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Secretarlu a cãsãbãlui, dupã tsi acumtinã multsãmea, dzãsi: “Bãrbats Efesienji, cai easti vahi atsel om tsi nu lu shti cã cãsãbãlu a Efesianjlor easti apãrãtorlu a templui a mariljei dumnidzoanji Artemisa sh-icoana a ljei tsi cãdzu dit tser? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Metsi aesti suntu ni-cundriti, voi prindi s-vã acumtinats shi s-nu fãtsets tsiva aĝunjisit. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Voi adusit aeshti oaminji tsi nu suntu nitsi furii di templi, nitsi blãstimãtori a dumnidzoanjiljei a voastrã. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Macã Dimitrul sh-masturlji tsi suntu cu nãsu, au tsiva contra a vãrui, giudicata easti discljis sh-proconsulji suntu, aclo s-giudicã unu cu altu. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ma macã avets tsiva altã, si s-ndreagã tu cuvendã dupã legea. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Noi him tu piricljiu s-him acuzats trã rebilipsirea di azã, cã nu ari vãrã itii cum si sitãxeascã adunarea aestã.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Sh-cum li dzãsi aesti, u arãspãndzã adunarea.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Prit Machidunii sh-prit Gãrtsii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Dupã tsi ascãpã tulburarea, Pavlu acljimã ucenitsilji ningã nãsu, lji inimusi, lji salutã shi s-nchisi cãtrã Machidunii. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Cãndu li tricu atseali locuri lã dãdea curaiu cu multi zboari atsilor oaminji sh-deapoea vini tu Gãrtsii. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Aclo armasi di trei meshi. Cãndu ma s-fãtsea etimu s-njidzea tu Siri, Iudeilji avea curdusit un plan contra lui, trã atsea elu apofãsi si s-turna prit Machidunii. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Pavlu eara sotsãsit di Sopatru, hiljilu al Piro di Veria, Aristarcu sh-Secundul di Sãruna, Gailu di Derbe, Timoteu, Titicu sh-Trofimu di Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Aeshti eara nchisitã ma nãinti di noi sh-nã ashtipta tu Troas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Iarã noi nã nchisim prit amari di Filipii dupã sãrbãtoarea a Adzãmilor sh-di tsintsi dzãli agiumsim ãn Troas, iu armasim shapti dzãli.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Euticul Nyeat dit Mortsã n-Troas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ma tu prota dzuã a stãmãnãljei, cãndu noi ucenitsilji earam adunatsi ti frãndzearea a pãniljei, Pavlu, cai prindea s-nchisea alantã dzuã, zbura cu nãshi sh-cuvenda s-lundzi pãnã tu njeadzãnoapti. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Tu udãlu di nsus iu eara adunats avea multã lunjinã. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Un tinir cu numa Eutic, tsi shidea pri pirvazu a fireastrãljei, lu acãtsã un somnu greu, anda Pavlu lundzea zborlu. Cum lu acãtsã somnu, cãdzu mpadi di la a treia patumã nghios sh-lu scularã mortu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Atumtsea Pavlu, cum dipunã, s-aplicã pristi nãsu, luãnda mbratsã tinirlu sh-dzãsi: “Nu vã tulburats, cã suflitlu a lui easti tu elu.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Atumtsea s-alinã nãpoi, frãmsi pãni sh-mãcã. Elu lã zburã pãnã tu apiritã sh-deapoea s-nchisi. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Elji lu dusirã ficiorlu yiu shi s-diznjirdarã multu. <verse eid="ACT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Iarã noi tsi earam alinat tu cãravi ma nãinti, nãftisim cãtrã Assos, iu vream s-loam Pavlu. Elu avea apofãsitã ashãtsi s-dutsea aclo pri cicioari. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Cãndu nã agiumsi ãn Assos, lom Pavlul cu noi sh-nã dusim tu Mitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Alantã dzuã nãftisim di-aclo sh-agiumsim agnanghea di Hios. Unã dzuã ma nãpoi agiumsim Samos. Alantã dzuã agiumsim ãn Milet. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Tra s-nu s-amãnã tu Asia, Pavlul avea apofãsit s-nãftãsea prit ningã Efes, cã s-aĝunjisea s-agiundzea ãn Ierusalem dzua a Arusaljilor. <verse eid="ACT 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Elu dit Milet pitricu tu Efes tsi s-acljima aushlji a bisearicãljei. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Sh-cãndu elji vinirã la elu, Pavlu lã dzãsi: “Voi shtits di tu prota dzuã, tsi intrai tu Asii, cã cum am fut cu voi totãna, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />huzmitipsinda a Domnului cu multã aplicãciuni sh-cu multi lãcrinji sh-cu cãrtirili tsi nji-vinirã dit drãcsirili a Iudeilor. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Voi shtits cã mini nu vã am ascumtu tsiva di atseali tsi eara di hãiri, ma vã am predicatã a voauã sh-vã nvitsai nãintea a lumiljei sh-prit cãsi, <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />mãrtirsinda a Iudeilor sh-a Gretsilor mitãnjiusirea la Dumnidzãlu sh-pistipsirea la Domnul a nostru Isus. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Tora, Duhlu mi cãlãuzaeshti s-mi duc tu Ierusalem nishtinda cã tsi va nji-undzeascã aclo. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Mini shtiu mash cã Duhlu Sãmtu mãrtirseashti trã mini tu cathi cãsãbã, dzãcãnda cã mi ashteaptã prãnghi sh-munduiri. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ma mini nu voi s-shtiu di tsiva sh-nitsi bana a mea nu u tinjisescu ahãntu multu, pãnã-cãndu si mplinescu cu harauã calea a mea sh-huzmitipsirea, tsi u loai di la Domnul Isus s-mãrtirsescu didip Evanghelu a harului a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Tora shtiu cã tuts voi prit cai tricui predicãnda amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui, nu va-u videts ma fatsa a mea. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Trã atsea azã ma vã dau mãrtirii cã mini escu chischin di sãndzili a tutulor. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Mini nu mi afirii tra s-nu vã dimãndu tutã nãetea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />S-avets cãshtiga, trã voi sh-trã tuts cupia, pristi cai Duhlu Sãmtu vã ari bãgat voi episcochi tra s-vigljeats bisearica a Dumnidzãlui, tsi elu u-amintã cu sãndzili a lui. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Cã mini shtiu cã dupã fudzearea a mea, va s-intrã tu mesea a voastrã luchi arãchitori, tsi nu va s-aibã njilã di cupia. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Namisa di voi va sã scoalã bãrbats tsi va s-vã nveatsã nvitsãturi strãmbi, tsi s-tragã dupã nãshi ucenitsi. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Trã atsea stats dishtiptat shi adutsets aminti cã trei anji ni-curmat nu pãpsii pute noapti sh-dzuã s-vã prispuneam a cathiunui cu lãcri. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Tora, mini ma vã-alasã la Dumnidzãlu sh-la zborlu a harului a lui, cai poati s-vã facã shi s-vã da mushtinirea namisa di tuts sãmtsãlji. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Mini nu vrui nits asimi, nits furii, nits stranjili a vãrui. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Sh-voi shtits cã aesti mãnji au lucratã trã ananghili a meali sh-trã atselji, cai eara deadun cu mini. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Tu itsido vã am aspusã cã, lucrãnda ahãntu multu, prindi s-agiutats lãndzitslji shi s-adutsem aminti zboarili a Domnului Isus, cai dzãsi: ‘Ma mari easti haraua s-dai dicãt s-ljeai!’” <verse eid="ACT 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Shi, dupã tsi avea dzãsã aesti s-aplicã pri dzinuclji deadun cu elji shi s-rugã. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Atumtsea tuts plãmsirã cu mari, lu ambrãtsisirã Pavlul sh-lu bãsharã. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Elji simtsãrã multã dureari di zborlu tsi avea dzãsã, cã nu va l-videa ma fatsa a lui. Deapoea lu-dusirã la cãravi.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Calea cãtrã Ierusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Dupã tsi nã dispãrtsãm di elji, nãftim sh-nã dusim ndreptu tu Cos, alantã dzuã tu Rodos sh-di aclo tu Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Deapoea aflãm unã cãravi tsi njidzea tu Fenichia, n-alinãm sh-nãftim. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Vidzum di diparti Chipro, lu alãsãm di nastãnga, nãftim cãtrã Siria sh-agiumsim tu Tiro, cã aclo cãravea prindi s-discãrca ncãrcãtura. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Aclo aflãm ucenitsilji sh-dãnãsim cu elji shapti dzãli. Prit Duh elji lj-dzãtsea al Pavlu s-nu s-dutsea tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Cãndu tricurã atseali shapti dzãli nã nchisim sh-nã dusim. Tuts nã sotsãsirã deadun cu muljerili sh-cu cilimenjlji pãnã tu ishita a cãsãbãlui. Mardzina di amari nã aplicãm pri dzinuclji sh-nã rugãm. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Apoea nã salutãm cu un-alantu, nã alinãm tu cãravi, iarã elji s-turnarã la cãsili a lor. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Cãndu bitisim nãftirea, di Tiro agiumsim tu Ptolemaida. Aclo nã salutãm cu fratslji sh-surãrili shi-shidzum unã dzuã cu elji. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Alantã dzuã nã nchisim sh-nã dusim tu Cesarea, intrãm tu casa al Filip evanghelistul, cai eara un di shaptilji<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Fap 6:5</ref>.</char></note> shi shidzum la nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Elu avea patru feati virghini tsi prufitipsea. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Cãndu noi aveam niscãnti dzãli tsi stãteam aclo, dipunã di Iudea un prufit cu numa Agab. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Elu vini la noi, lo curaua al Pavlu, ligã mãnjili sh-cicioarili a lui sh-dzãsi: “Aestã dzãtsi Duhlu Sãmtu: ‘Ashãtsi Iudeilji va leagã tu Ierusalem bãrbatlu, cai ari aestã curauã, sh-va lu da tu mãnjili a pãngãnjilor.’” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Cãndu avdzãm aesti zboari, noi sh-bãnãtorlji di aclo lji nã rugãm al Pavlu s-nu njidzea tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Atumtsea Pavlu lã apãndisi: “Cã tse plãndzets sh-nji durmits inima? Mini escu etimu nu mash cãndu escu ligat, ma shi s-mor tu Ierusalem trã numa a Domnului Isus.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Shi, metsi nu lji si umplu mintea, noi tãcum sh-dzãsim: “Si s-facã vrearea a Domnului!” <verse eid="ACT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Dupã atseali dzãli, nã etimãsim sh-nã alinãm cãtrã Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Cu noi vinirã sh-niscãntsã ucenitsi di Cesarea sh-nã dusirã la un Mnason di Chipro, un ucenic vecljiu la cai va stãteam.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Agiumsi tu Ierusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Cãndu noi agiumsim tu Ierusalem, fratslji sh-surãrili nã ashtiptarã cu harauã. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Alantã dzuã Pavlu vini cu noi la Iacovul. Aclo avea vinit tuts aushlji a bisearicãljei. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Dupã tsi s-ambrãtsisirã, Pavlul lã spusi a lor un pi un, tuti atseali tsi featsi Domnul prit pãngãnjlji cu huzmitipsirea a lui. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Cãndu avdzãrã aestã, elji multumãrirã Domnul sh-lji dzãsirã al Pavlu: “Frate, tini ma vedz cã njilji di Iudei pistipsescu sh-ninga s-ducã dupã legea. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Elji au avdzãtã cã tini lji nvets Iudeilji, tsi bãneadzã ntrã natsiunili s-dipãrteadzã di legea al Moisiu, dzãcãnda s-nu facã anvãrliga-tãljeari a hiljilor a lor shi s-nu urmeadzã adetsili a noastri. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Tsi s-fãtsem? Elji fãrã di altã va s-avdã cã tini ai vinitã. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Fã aestã tsi ts-dzãtsem. Cu noi suntu patru bãrbats, tsi au faptã unã spigiurari. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ljea aeshti, curã-ti cu nãshi sh-plãtea trã elji tra surseascã caplu. Ashãtsi tuts va shtibã cã nu suntu tsiva atseali tsi au avdzãtã trã tini, cã sh-tini imnji dupã legea. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Iarã a pistimenjilor pãngãnji, noi lã avem scriatã unã carti sh-avem apofãsitã tsi elji si s-apãrã di curbãnsirili a idoljilor, di sãndzili, di nimaljilji supsiti sh-di putãnsirea.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Atumtsea Pavlu lji lo cu nãsu bãrbatslji sh-alantã dzuã, dupã tsi s-curarã deadun, intrarã tu templu, dimãndãnda mplinirea a dzãlilor trã curari, pãnã cãndu s-featsi curbãnsirea trã cathiunu di elji.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlul lu Acãtsarã tu Templu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Cãndu ma ascãpa shapti dzãlili, Iudeilji a Asiiljei vidzurã Pavlul tu templu, tãrãsirã tutã multsãmea sh-lu acãtsarã. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Elji aurla: “Bãrbats Israelits, nã agiutats! Aestu easti atsel om cai nveatsã tuts sh-iutsido contra a popului a nostru, contra a legiljei, sh-contra aishtui loc. Elu ari adus sh-Elinji tu templu sh-ashãtsi ari pãngãnitã aestu loc sãmtu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Elji avea vidzutã Pavlul ma nãinti tu cãsabã deadun cu Trofimul di Efes sh-minduea cã Pavlu lu avea adusã tu templu.) <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Atumtsea tut cãsãbãlu s-tulburã sh-populu s-adunã di tuti cãljuri. Lu acãtsarã Pavlul, lu scoasirã nafoarã di templu azvara sh-portsãli si ncljisirã trãoarã. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Cãndu ma cãfta s-lu vãtãma, hãbarea s-dusi la tribunlu a cohortãljei Romanã, cã tut Ierusalemlu eara tulburat. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Elu lo niscãntsã suldats sh-niscãntsã tsenturionji shi s-dusi trãoarã cãtrã multsãmea. Elji, vidzãnda tsenturionlu sh-suldatslji, dãnãsirã s-batã Pavlul. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Atumtsea tribunlu s-apruche, acãtsã Pavlul sh-ordinã s-lu leagã cu doi singiri. Deapoea apãrnji s-lu ntreabã cã cai eara sh-tsi avea faptã. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Niscãntsã oaminji di multsãmea aurla sh-dzãtsea unã tsiva, iarã alantsãlji altã tsiva. Metsi nu putu s-loa di hãbari alihea trã itia a mintituriljei, ordinã s-aduc Pavlul tu castelu. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Cãndu Pavlu agiumsi la scãri, multsãmea eara sãluitã sh-suldatslji prindea s-lu purta. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Multsãmea tsi ma yinea dinãpoi, aurla: “Vãtãmats-lu!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Cãndu ma lu dutsea tu castelu, lji dzãsi a tribunlui: “Pot s-tsã dzãc tsiva?” Iarã elu ntribã: “Shtii gãrtseshti? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Nu eshti tini Eghyptianlu tsi nãinti di niscãnti dzãli arãsculash shi scutesh tu irnjii patru njilji di vãtãmãtori?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pavlu apãndisi: “Mini escu un om Iudeu di Tarsu a Chilichiiljei, bãnãtor a unui cãsãbã avdzãt. Tsã fac rigeai dã-nji volje s-lji grescu a popului.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Tribunul lji deadi volje sh-Pavlul stãtu mprostu la scãri, lj-featsi semnu cu mãna a popului ti tãtseari. Cum s-featsi mari tãtseari, lji grãi a popului pi uvreascã.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu lj-Greashti a Multsãmiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Bãrbats, frats sh-prots, avdzãts tora apãrarea a mea nãintea a voastrã.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Cãndu avdzãrã cã ma lã zbura pi limba uvreascã, tãcurã sh-ma multu sh-elu dzãsi: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Mini escu un om Iudeu, amintat tu Tarsul a Chilichiiljei sh-criscut tu aestu cãsãbã la cicioarili al Gamaliel. Mini escu nvitsat dupã Legea a pãrintsãlor a noshtri, mplin di vreari di Dumnidzãlu, ashã cum hits voi tuts azã. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Mini am avinatã urmashlji aishtei Cali pãnã tu moarti, ligãnda sh-bãgãnda tu hapsi bãrbats sh-muljeri. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Ashãtsi da mãrtirii ti mini arhipreftul sh-tut aushaticlu, di la cai loai sh-cãrtsi ti fratslji sh-mi dush tu Damascu ti adutseari ligats tu Ierusalem atselji cai eara aclo trã giudicari. <verse eid="ACT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Shi s-featsi tsi, cãndu earam pri cali sh-ma mi aprucheam di Damascu cãtrã njeadzã-dzuã, niashtiptat unã lunjinã mari dit tser strãlutsi anvãrliga di mini. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Mini cãdzui mpadi sh-avdzãi unã boatsi tsi ma nj-dzãtsea: ‘Saul, Saul, cãtse mi priaĝuneshti?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Mini apãndisii: ‘Cai eshti tini, Doamne?’ Elu nj-dzãsi: ‘Mini escu Isus Nazareanlu, tsi tini lu priaĝuneshti.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Atselji tsi eara cu mini u vidzurã lunjina, ma nu avdzãrã boatsea atsilui, tsi nj-grãi. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Mini ntribai: ‘Doamne, tsi s-fac?’ Domnul nj-dzãsi: ‘Scoalã-ti sh-duti tu Damasc! Sh-aclo va li dzãcã tuti atseali tsi tini prindi s-fatsi.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Cãndu mini nu videam trã itia a strãlutsiriljei atsiljei lunjini, intrai tu Damasc mãnã di mãnã cu atselji, cai eara cu mini. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Anania, un om dumnidzãsit dupã Legea, ti cai dãdea mãrtirii bunã tuts Iudeilji, tsi bãna aclo, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />vini la mini shi, stãnda ningã mini, dzãsi: ‘Saul, frate, mutrea nãpoi!’ Sh-tu oara atsea mini discljish ocljilji sh-vidzui atsel. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Atumtsea elu dzãsi: ‘Dumnidzãlu a pãrintsãlor a noshtri ti aleapsi s-cunoshti vrearea a lui, s-lu vedz Ndreptul shi s-avdzã grailu di gura a lui. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Tini va s-hii martir nãintea a tuts oaminjlor trã atseali tsi ai vidzut sh-ai avdzãt. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Sh-tora, tsi ma ashteptsã? Scoalã-ti, pãteadzã-ti sh-curã-ti di amãrtiili a tali, acljimãnda numa a lui.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Cãndu mi turnai tu Ierusalem sh-earam rugãnda tu templu, tricui tu viziuni, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />sh-vidzui Domnul tsi nj-dzãtsea: ‘Aĝunjisea-ti sh-dipãrteadz-ti trãoarã di Ierusalem, cã elji nu va-u ascultã mãrtiria a ta trã mini.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Atumtsea mini dzãsh: ‘Doamne, elji shtiu cã mini tu sinagogã earam atsel cai bãgam tu hapsi sh-bãteam atselji, cai pistipsea la tini. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Cãndu s-virsã sãndzili al Stefan, a martirlui a tãu, mini earam aclo u aprovam vãtãmarea a lui sh-vigljeam stranjili atsilor cai lu vãtãmarã.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Atumtsea Domnul nji dzãsi: ‘Imnã, cã mini va ti pitrec diparti la pãngãnjlji.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Cãsãbunjiu Roman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Elji lu ascultarã pãnã la aestu zbor, deapoea scularã boatsea dzãcãnda: “Mutats-lu di lumi un ahtar-om, cã nu prindi s-bãneadzã!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Multsãmea aurla, arca stranjili nsus shi scula pulbirlu tu aerã. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Atumtsea tribunlu ursi s-lu adutsea Pavlul tu castel sh-lã dzãsi a lor s-lu ntreabã shi s-lu batã cu cãmciclu, tsi s-loa di hãbari cã ti tsi aurla populu contra a lui. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ma cãndu lu ashtirnarã mpadi ligatã cu curãi, Pavlu lji dzãsi a tsenturionlui cai eara atsia: “Easti tu lege ti voi s-bãtets cu cãmcichi un cãsãbunjiu roman, nigiudicat?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Cãndu u avdzã aestã, tsenturionlu s-dusi sh-lji spusi a tribunlui dzãcãnda: “Tsi va fatsã cu aestu? Cã aestu om easti cãsãbunjiu roman!” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Atumtsea tribunlu s-dusi la Pavlu sh-lu ntribã: “Dzã-nji, eshti cãsãbunjiu roman?” Elu dzãsi: “Ie.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Tribunlu lj-apãndisi: “Mini am amintat aestã cãsãbunjii cu multi pãradzi.” Sh-Pavlul dzãsi: “Iarã mini mi-am amintat cãsãbunjiu roman!” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Trãoarã atselji tsi va lu ntriba, s-dipãrtarã di la nãsu. Tribunlu, cãndu lo di hãbari cã eara cãsãbunjiu roman, avu fricã tsi lu-tsinea ligatã.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu nãintea a Sinedriului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Tribunlu vrea si siguripsea cãtse Pavlul eara acuzat di Iudeilji. Dzua atsea alanta, elu lu sãlãghi sh-ursi arhipreftsãlji sh-tut Sinedriul s-adunã. Deapoea elu adusi Pavlul sh-lu bãgã si sta nãinti a lor.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pavlu mutri cãtrã Sinedriul sh-dzãsi: “Frats a melji, mini pãnã azã am bãnat cu conshtintsã curatã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Atumtsea arhipreftul Anania ordinã atselji cai stãtea ningã Pavlu s-lu agudea pi gurã. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Atumtsea Pavlu lj-dzãsi a lui: “Dumnidzãlu va ti agudeascã tini, ipucrit!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“ipucrit” va s-dzãc “mur alãghit” </char></note> Tini eshti apunat aclo s-mi giudits dupã legea, ma cãlcãnda legea, tini dai ordin s-mi agudeascã.” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Atselji cai stãtea ningã Pavlul lj-dzãsirã: “Cum cutidzeshti tini s-ngiuri arhipreftul a Dumnidzãlui?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pavlu apãndisi: “Frats, nu shtiam cã elu eara arhipreftu, cã easti scriat: ‘S-nu greshti arãu trã mãrlji a popului a tãu.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Ex 22:28</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Atumtsea Pavlu, shtinda cã niscãntsã eara Sadutsei sh-altsãlji eara Farisei, grãi tu Sinedriu cu boatsi analtã: “Frats, mini escu Fariseu sh-hiljiu di Fariseu. Mini ma mi giudicã cã nãdãescu tu nyearea a mortsãlor.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Macãt elu dzãsi aestã, apãrnji unã ngrãnji ntrã Fariseilji sh-Sadutseilji sh-adunarea s-dispãrtsã. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Sadutseilji dzãc cã nu ari nyeari, nits anghilji, nits duhuri, ma Fariseilji pistipsescu tu tuti aesti.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Aclo s-avdzãrã mãri aurlari, sh-niscãntsã nvitsãtori a legiljei dit Fariseilji si scularã sh-ncuntrarã cu aspru: “Noi nu aflãm vãrã arãu la aestu om,” dzãsirã elji. “Vahi lj-ari zburãtã un duh icã un anghil?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Cãndu ncãcearea ma s-fãtsea ma mari, tribunlu avu fricã cã elji va s-lu dinjica Pavlul. Trã atsea ursi suldatslji s-njidzea s-loa Pavlul di mãnjili a lor, shi s-lu adutsea tu castelu. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Unã noapti ma nãpoi Domnul lj-stãtu aproapi al Pavlu sh-lji-dzãsi: “Ljea curaiu! Cum ai mãrtirsit trã mini tu Ierusalem, ashãtsi prindi s-mãrtirseshti sh-Roma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Complotlu contra al Pavlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Dimineatsa Iudeilji ndreapsirã un complot shi si spigiurarã cã nu va mãca sh-nu va bea pãnã cãndu s-lu vãtãma Pavlul. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Atselji tsi s-featsirã deadun tu aestu complot eara ma multu di patrudzãtsi di bãrbats. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Elji s-dusirã la arhipreftsãlji sh-la aushlji sh-lã dzãsirã: “Noi him spigiurats deadun tra s-nu mãcãm tsiva pãnã cãndu s-avem vãtãmat Pavlul. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Trã atsea, voi shi Sinedriul prindi s-lji cãftats a tribunlui tsi s-lu aduc nãintea a voastrã fãcãnda taha voi vrets s-shtits ma multu trã nãsu. Noi him etinji s-lu vãtãmãm ma nãinti tsi s-agiungã aoatsi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ma cãndu hiljilu a sorãljei al Pavlu avdzã trã aestu complot, fudzi la castelu shi lj-spusi al Pavlu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Atumtsea Pavlu acljimã unu di tsenturionjlji shi lj-dzãsi: “Pitreats-lu aestu ficior la tribunlu, cã ari tsiva trã dzãtseari.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ashãtsi elu lo tinirlu, lu dusi la tribunlu sh-lji dzãsi: “Pavlu hãpsãnitlu, mi pitricu sh-nji cãftã s-aduc aestu ficior la voi cã ari tsiva trã dzãtseari.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Tribunlu lo ficiorlu di mãnã s-dusi dinãparti sh-lu ntribã: “Tsi vrei s-nji dzãts?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Elu apãndisi: “Niscãntsã Iudei suntu faptã pi unã minti s-tsã caftã s-lu aduts mãni Pavlul nãintea a Sinedriului, fãcãnda taha vor s-shtii ma multu trã nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Nu lji asclutã atselji, cã ma multu di patrudzãtsi di bãrbats suntu etinji s-easã nãintea a lui. Elji suntu spigiurats deadun s-nu mãcã shi s-nu bea pãnã cãndu s-vatãmã Pavlul. Tora elji suntu etinji, sh-ma ashteaptã tsi tini si mplineshti cãftarea a lor.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Atumtsea tribunlu lu nchisi ficiorlu sh-lji dzãsi: “Nu lj-spuni a vãrui tsi nj-ai dzãsã.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adutsearea al Pavlu tu Cesarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Atumtsea elu acljimã doi tsenturionjlji sh-lã dzãsi: “Etimãsits-vã s-vã nchisits anvãrliga di oara noauã a noaptiljei cãtrã Cesarea cu doauã suti di suldats, shaptidzãtsi di cãvãlari shi doauã sutã di sãdzetari. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Etimãsits un calu trã Pavlu tsi s-lu adutsets sãnãtos la guvernatorlu Felix.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Elu scrie unã carti, la cai dzãtsea ashãtsi:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Claudiu Lisia,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="ACT 23:26">a Exelentului, Guvernatorlu Felix,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="ACT 23:26">Salutari!<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Atsel om eara acãtsat di Iudeilji shi elji vrea s-lu vãtãma, ma dupã tsi nvitsai cã eara cãsãbunjiu Roman, intrai cu suldatslji a melji sh-lu ascãpai di mãnjili a lor. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Mini vream sã shtiam cai eara cãbatea trã cai elji lu acuza, sh-trã atsea lu dush nãintea a Sinedriului a lor. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Aclo nvitsai cã lu acuza trã niscãnti lucri di legea a lor, ma dealihea nu avea faptã vãrã cãbati trã muriri icã trã hãpsãniri. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Cãndu nji spusirã di un complot contra aishtui om, lu pitricui trãoarã la voi. Tutashã, ursii acuzatorlji a lui tra si zburãscã cu tini trã nãsu.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ashã suldatslji lu loarã Pavlul, sh-dupã ordinlu lu dusirã noaptea pãnã tu Antipatridã. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Alantã dzua elji alãsarã cãvãlarlji s-njidzea cu nãsu, iarã suldatslji s-turnarã tu castel. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Cãvãlarlji agiumsirã tu Cesarea, lji deadirã cartea a guvernatorlui sh-prideadirã Pavlul. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Guvernatorlu cãntã cartea, ntribã Pavlul di cai loc eara, sh-cãndu nvitsã cã eara di Chilichia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />lj-dzãsi: “Va ti ascultã cãndu s-yinã atselji cai ti au acuzat.” Deapoea elu ursi s-lu tsãnea Pavlul vigljat tu pretoriulu al Herod.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Nãintea al Felix</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Dupã tsintsi dzãli vinirã nghios tu Cesarea Anania arhipreftul cu niscãntsã aushi sh-cu un avucat cu numa Tertul. Elji lji spusirã a guvernatorlui tsi avea contra al Pavlu. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Cãndu Pavlu s-acljimã nãuntru, Tertulu apãrnji acuza contra a lui dzãcãnda: “Multu-tinjisit Felix, prit tini noi avem avut pace ti multu chiro sh-cu cãshtiga a ta suntu fapti reformi mãri trã aestu popul. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Noi apruchem cu hãristisiri aestã iutsido sh-totãna. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ma, ni vrut s-ti tsãn multu, tsã fac rigeai cu a ta bunãtati s-nã ascultsã ti ndoauã zboari. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Noi avem vidzut aestu om tsi fatsi mintituri, sh-lji pindzi Iudeilji trã rebilipsiri tu tutã lumea. Elu easti caplu a sectului a Nazareanjilor. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Elu s-cilistisi s-pãngãnea templu, ma noi lu acãtsãm. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />[Ma vini tribunlu Lisia, sh-lu lo cu zori di mãnjili a noastri.] <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Tini giudicãnda, va pots s-nvetsi di la nãsu itsido trã cai ma lu acuzãm.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Cu aestã acuzã s-featsirã deadun sh-alantsã Iudei sh-dzãsirã cã lucrili ashãtsi suntu.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Cãndu guvernatorlu lj-featsi semnu al Pavlu, elu apãndisi: “Mini shtiu cã di mults anji eshti giudicãtor a popului a nostru, trã atsea pistipsescu la tini trã apãrarea a mea. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Tini pots s-nvets lishor cã nu suntu ma multu di doisprãdzatsi di dzãli di cãndu mi alinai tu Ierusalem trã alãvdari. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Aeshti nu mi au aflatã ngrãnjinda cu vãrã tu templu, icã sculãnda multsãmea tu sinagodzi icã iuva tu cãsãbã. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Elji nu pot s-alihipseascã acuzãli tsi nji li fac tora a njia. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Mini mãrtirsescu cã mãrescu Dumnidzãlu a pãrintsãlor a noshtri dupã Calea, tsi elji u-acljeam sect. Mini pistipsescu tu itsido tsi esti scriat tu Lege sh-tu itsido tsi easti scriat la Prufitsilji. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Mini am idyia nãdii tu Dumnidzãlu di cum aeshti oaminji, cã ndreptsãlji sh-nindreptsãlji va s-nyeadzã. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Trã aestã totãna caftu s-am conshtintsã curatã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui sh-nãintea a tuts oaminjlor. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Tora dupã multsã anji mi turnai tu Ierusalem trã adutseari agiutãri a popului a meu sh-trã curbãnsiri trã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Cãndu Iudeilji mi aflarã tu uborlu a templui, mini earam curat cum prindi. Aclo nu avea nitsi multsãmi sh-nitsi mintiturã. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Aclo eara niscãntsã Iudei di Asia, tsi prindi s-ishea nãintea a ta shi s-mi acuza, macã avea tsiva contra mini, <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />icã aeshti cai suntu aoa prindi sã spunã tsi nindriptati aflarã la mini cãndu stãteam nãintea a Sinedriului. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Mini mi giudicã mash di un zbor tsi mini dzãsh cu boatsi analtã nãintea a lor: ‘Mini ma mi giudic azã di voi cã pistipsescu tu nyearea a mortsãlor.’” <verse eid="ACT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ma Felixul, cai cunushtea ghini Calea, amãnã giudicarea, dzãcãnda: “Cãndu s-dipunã di Ierusalem tribunlu Lisia, va s-ljea apofãsi trã lucrul a vostru.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Deapoea elu ursi tsenturionlu s-veaglji Pavlul, ma s-lji dãdea putsãn libertati shi s-lu alãsa s-aduna cu sotslji a lui s-lji huzmitipsea tu ananghili a lui.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Dupã niscãnti dzãli, cãndu vini Felixul cu muljearea a lui, Drusila, tsi eara uvreauã, acljimã Pavlul shi avdzã di la nãsu trã pistea a Hristolui Isus. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Cãndu Pavlu grãi trã ndriptatea, contsãnearea sh-trã giudicata tsi ma yini, Felixul s-aspãrã shi lj-dzãsi: “Tora, pots s-ti duts. Va ti acljem cãndu s-am chiro.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Tu aestã oarã, Felixul avea nãdii cã Pavlul va lj-dãdea pãradzi a lui, trã atsea lu acljima di multi ori shi zbura cu nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Cum tricurã doi anji, dupã Felixul vini Portsiu Festi. Metsi Felixul vrea s-lj fãtsea tinjii a Iudeilor, alãsã Pavlul tu hapsi.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Giudicarea al Pavlu Nãintea al Festu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Dupã trei dzãli tsi avea vinit tu provintsã, Festu di Cesarea s-alinã tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Arhipreftsãlji shi mãrlji a Iudeilor lji pãrãstisirã acuzãli a lor contra al Pavlu sh-lji si rugarã. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Elji lj-cãftarã al Festu unã tinjii, tsi s-pitritsea Pavlul tu Ierusalem, cã elji avea etimãsit un lats tra s-lu vãtãma pri cali. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festul apãndãsi: “Pavlu s-veaglji tu Cesarea sh-mini idyiul va mi duc curundu aclo. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Niscãntsã di mãrlji a voshtri s-yinã cu mini, sh-macã atsel om ari vãrã cãbati, elji si spunã acuzãli cãtrã nãsu.” <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Dupã tsi armasi namisa di nãshi nu ma multu di optu icã dzatsi dzãli, Festul s-dusi tu Cesarea. Alantã dzua shidzu tu thronlu a giudicãtorlui sh-ordinã s-adutsea Pavlul. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Cãndu Pavlu intrã nãuntru, lu anvãrligarã Iudeilji cai avea dipunat di Ierusalem. Elji featsirã acuzi greli contra nãsu, ma tsi nu putea s-li alihipsea. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Pavlu s-apãrã ashãtsi: “Mini nu am faptã amãrtii nitsi contra Legea a Iudeilor, nitsi contra templu icã nitsi contra a Cesarului.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Festul, metsi vru s-lã fãtsea tinjii a Iudeilor, ntribã Pavlul: “Vrei s-ti duts tu Ierusalem shi s-ti giudits nãintea a mea trã aesti acuzi?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pavlu lj-apãndisi: “Mini escu nãintea a giudicatãljei a Cesarului sh-aoatsi prindi s-mi giudicã. Mini nu am faptã vãrã nindriptati a Iudeilor, sh-tini shtii multu ghini. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Macã mini escu cãbatar sh-axizescu moartea, escu etimu s-mor. Ma macã acuzãli tsi aducã Iudeilji nu suntu dealihea, vãrã nu ari ndriptati s-mi prida mini tu mãnjili a lor. Mini caftu s-mi giudic di Cesarlu!” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Atumtsea Festul dupã tsi grãi cu consiliul a lui, apãndisi: “Cãftash s-ti giudits di Cesarlu, la Cesarlu va ti duts.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Festu sh-Amirãlu Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Dupã tsi tricurã niscãnti dzãli amirãlu Agripa sh-Bernica agiumsirã tu Cesarea tra s-fãtsea vizitã la Festu. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Metsi elji ma stãtea aclo niscãnti dzãli, Festu lji spusi al amirãlu trã Pavlu. Elu dzãsi: “Aoa easti un om tsi Felixu lu ari alãsat tu hapsi. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Cãndu earam tu Ierusalem, arhipreftsãlji sh-aushlji a Iudeilor acuzarã Pavlul shi cãftarã s-lu condamna. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Mini lã dzãsh cã nu easti adetea a Romanjilor s-condamnã vãrã, nãinti tsi acuzatlu s-aibã nãinti acuzãtorlji a lui tra s-poatã si s-apãrã di acuza tsi lji si fatsi. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Cãndu elji vinirã aoa, mini nu mi amãnai, ma tu alantã dzua shidzui tu thronlu a giudicãtorlui shi ded ordin s-nji adutsea atsel om. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Cãndu acuzatorlji si scularã trã greari, elji nu avurã vãrã acuzã contra al Pavlu trã atseali tsi mini ashtiptam. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ma elji avea namisa di nãshi niscãnti lucri di pistea a lor tsi s-ncuntra cu un alantu, sh-trã un om acljimat Isus tsi avea murit, ma Pavlu dzãtsea cã easti yiu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Metsi nu shtiam cum s-u cãftam aestã arasti, mini ntribai Pavlul macã elu vrea s-dutsea tu Ierusalem s-giudica trã aesti lucri. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Pavlu idyiul cãfta s-lu tsãnea apãrat pãnã cãndu s-apofãsea imperatorlu. Trã atsea ordinai s-lu veaglji pãnã cãndu s-lu pitretseam la Cesarlu.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Atumtsea Agripa lj-dzãsi al Festu: “Mini voi s-lu avdu aestu om.” Elu apãndisi: “Mãni va lu avdzi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pavlu Nãintea al Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Alantã dzua Agripa shi Berenica vinirã cu mari sãltãnati. Elji intrarã tu sala a ascultariljei deadun cu tribunjlji sh-bãrbatslji tinjisits a cãsãbãlui. Atumtsea Festul ordinã s-adutsea Pavlul. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festul dzãsi: “Amirã Agripa, sh-voi tuts tsi hits aoa cu noi! Voi videts aestu om, trã cai tuts Iudeilji nj-au cãftat cum tu Ierusalem sh-aoatsi, aurlãnda tsi elu nu prindi s-bãneadzã ma. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ma mini nu aflai vãrã cãbati tsi elu s-axizeascã moartea. Macã elu ari cãftat s-giudicã la Imperatorlu, mini apofãsii s-lu pitrec Roma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ma nu am tsiva s-lji scriu a domnului a meu trã nãsu. Trã atsea, lu adush aoa nãintea a voastrã, shi ma multu nãintea a ta, amirã Agripa, dupã tsi s-lu avem ntribat, s-shtiu tsi s-lji scriu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Cã nji-si-pari fãrã minti s-lu pitrec hãpsãnitlu Roma fãrã vãrã acuzã contra a lui.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agripa lj-dzãsi al Pavlu: “Tini ai ndreptul si zburashti.” Pavlu sculã mãna shi ahurhi apãrarea a lui: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Mini escu hãros tsi s-mi apãrã azã nãintea a ta, amirã Agripa, di tuti acuzãli a Iudeilor contra mini, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />cã ma multu tini li cunoshti ghini adetsili sh-ngrãnjili a Iudeilor. Trã atsea, tsã fac rigeai s-mi avdzã cu arãvdari. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Tuts Iudeilji shtiu cã cum am bãnat di njicu, dit ahurhita a banãljei a mea tu loclu a meu sh-tut ashã tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Elji mi cunoscu di multu chiro sh-pot s-mãrtirseascã cã mini earam parti di sectul ma strictu a pistiljei a noastrã sh-cum am bãnat ca un Fariseu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Iarã tora stau aoa tra s-mi giudic cã nãdãescu tu tãxirea a Dumnidzãlui cãtrã pãrintsãlji a noshtri, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />tsi doisprãdzatsi fãrili a noastri nãdãescu s-agiungã, alãvdãnda Dumnidzãlu dzuã sh-noapti cu arãvdari. Trã aestã itii escu cãtigursit di Iudeilji, amirã Agripa. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Cãtse vã-si pari nipistipsit a voauã cã Dumnidzãlu lji nyeadzã mortsãlji? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Shi mini idyiul am minduit cã prindi s-fãtseam itsido tsi puteam contra a numãljei al Isus Nazareanlu. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Sh-atsea u-am faptã tu Ierusalem. Cu autoritatea tsi nj-deadirã arhipreftsãlji am arcat tu hapsi multsã di sãmtsãlji shi am dat vota cãndu elji s-condamnarã cu moarti. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Di multi ori tu tuti sinagodzãli escu cilistisit tsi cu zori s-lji stringu s-aleapid pistea a lor, sh-cu mari inati lji am priaĝunit pãnã tu cãsãbadzli xeani. <verse eid="ACT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Ashãtsi mi nchisii cãtrã Damascu avãnda autoritatea sh-voljea a arhipreftsãlor. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Pri cali cãtrã njeadzã-dzuã, amirã Agripa, vidzui unã lunjinã dit tser, tsi eara ma strãlutsit di soarili, tsi strãlutsi anvãrliga di mini sh-anvãrliga di atselji cai eara cu mini. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Cãdzum tuts mpadi sh-mini avdzãi unã boatsi tsi dzãtsea pi uvreascã: ‘Saul, Saul, cãtse mi priaĝuneshti? Easti greu trã voi s-agudits cu scoatsi contra a perunãljei.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Mini ntribai: ‘Cai eshti tini, Doamne?’ Domnul nj-apãndisi: ‘Mini escu Isusul tsi tini lu priaĝuneshti. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Tora scoalã-ti shi shedz pri cicioari. Mi aspush tra s-ti arãdãpsescu huzmichearlu a meu shi s-mãrtirseshti atseali tsi vidzush sh-atseali tsi va ts-aspun a tsãia. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Mini va ti apãrã sh-di populu a tãu sh-di pãngãnjlji iu ma ti pitrec tora. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Tini va s-lã discljidzi ocljilji a lor tra s-toarnã di tu scutidi tu lunjinã sh-di tu putearea a Satanlui tu Dumnidzã. Ashãtsi cu pistea la mini va ljea ljirtarea a amãrtiilor sh-mushtinirea namisa di sãmtsãlji.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Dupã aestã, amirã Agripa, nu mi feciu nicãndãrsit nãintea a viziuniljei tsereascã. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Apãrnjii s-preadicã ma nãinti atsilor di Damasc sh-deapoea atsilor tu Ierusalem sh-tu tut loclu a Iudeiljei, shi a pãngãnjilor, cã elji prindi s-mitãnjiuseascã shi si s-toarnã la Dumnidzãlu fãcãnda fapti axiusiti di mitãnjiusiri. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Di aestã itii Iudeilji mi acãtsarã tu templu sh-cãftarã s-mi vãtãma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Pãnã azã mi ari agiutat Dumnidzãlu sh-mini escu aoa trã dari mãrtirii la mãrlji sh-la njitslji. Mini nu dzãc tsiva altu di-cãt atseali tsi dzãsirã prufitsilji sh-Moisiu cã va s-undzea, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />cã Hristolu va si s-munduea, sh-va s-nyia protlu dit mortsã sh-deapoea va dimãnda lunjina a popului sh-a pãngãnjilor.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Iarã Pavlu ma dzãtsea aesti zboari trã apãrarea a lui, Festul dzãsi cu boatsi analtã: “Eshti zurlu Pavle! Nvitsãturili atseali multi ti au zurlitã.” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ma Pavlu dzãsi: “Mini nu escu zurlu, multu bune Feste, ma dzãc zboari di-alihea sh-di mintimenilji. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Amirãlu li shtii ghini aesti lucri, trã atsea mini zburãscu discljis cu nãsu. Escu sigur cã vãrã di aesti lucri nu easti nicunuscut trã nãsu, cã nu suntu fapti pi ascumtu. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Amirã Agripa, pistipseshti tini tu prufits? Mini shtiu cã tini pistipseshti.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Atumtsea Agripa lj-dzãsi al Pavlu: “Ninga putsãn sh-va mi cãndãrseshti sh-mini s-mi fac Crishtin.” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pavlu lji apãndisi: “Mini lj-fac rigeai a Dumnidzãlui cã curund icã amãnat nu mash tini ma sh-tuts atselji tsi ma mi ascultã azã s-facã ca mini, ma ni-fãrã aesti prãnghi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Atumtsea amirãlu, guvernatorlu, Bernica sh-tuts atselji cai eara apunat cu nãshi si scularã. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Cãndu ma fudzea dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Aestu om nu ari faptã tsiva tra s-axizeascã moartea icã hapsea.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Atumtsea Agripa lj-dzãsi al Festu: “Aestu om putea s-eara liberat, macã nu va eara faptã apel al Cezaru.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Nãfteashti Cãtrã Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Cãndu s-apofãsi tsi noi s-nãfteam cãtrã Italia, Pavlu sh-niscãntsã altsã hãpsãnit s-prideadirã la un tsenturion cu numa Iuliu, di cohorta Augusta. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Noi nã alinãm tu un pampor di Adramita, cai prindea s-tritsea prit porturili a coastilor di Asia sh-nã nchisim avãnda cu noi Aristarcul, un machedonian di Sãruna. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Alantã dzuã agiumsim tu Sidon. Iuliu s-aspusi cu bunã-vreari cu Pavlu sh-lu alãsã s-njidzea la oaspilji a lui s-avea sh-cãshtiga a lor. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Di aclo nã nchisim sh-nãftim ningã Chipro, cã vimturili eara contra. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Dupã tsi tricum amarea a Chilichiiljei sh-a Pamfiliiljei, agiumsim tu Mira ãn Lycia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Aclo tsenturionlu aflã un pampor di Alexandria tsi nãftea cãtrã Italia sh-nã alinã tu nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Ti niscãnti dzãli nãftim aĝalea sh-cu zori agiumsim agnanghea di Cnidi. Metsi vimtul eara contra di noi, nãftim di nghios a Cretãljei ningã Salmon. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Nãftim cu mari zori ningã coastea sh-agiumsim tu un loc cu numa “Porturi Buni.” Ningã nãsu eara sh-cãsãbãlu Lasea. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Avea tricut multu chiro sh-nãftirea eara faptã piriculoasã, cã avea tricut sh-chirolu di pãreasinjli a toamnãljei. Atumtsea Pavlu lã urnipsi: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Bãrbats, mini ma ved cã nãftirea va s-facã sh-ma greauã sh-cu zãrari mãri nu mash trã ncãrcãtura sh-trã pamporlu, ma sh-trã bana a noastrã.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ma tsenturionlu avdzã timonierlu sh-capitanlu a pamporlui sh-nu avdzã zborlu al Pavlu. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Metsi portul atsel nu eara bun ti iarna, multsãlji minduirã s-fudzea di aclo sh-ma s-putea s-agiundzea tu Fenix iu va tritsea sh-iarna. Atsel eara un port tu Creta, tsi videa cãtrã sud-ascãpitata sh-cãtrã nord-ascãpitata. <verse eid="ACT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Cãndu apãrnji si suflã un vimtu lishor, elji minduirã cã va s-uidisea nãftirea, scularã angurãli sh-tricurã pri ningã coasta a Cretãljei. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Nu tricu multu chiro sh-pri insulã apãrnji un vimtu furtunos tsi s-acljeamã Eurachilon. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Vimtul arãchi pamporlu sh-eara niputut s-nãfteam contra a vimtului. Ashãtsi noi nã prideadim. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Cãndu ma tritseam di nghios a unei insulã njicã tsi s-acljima Clauda cu zori acãtsãm di nou controlul a pamporlui. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Dupã tsi naftsãlji s-alinarã tu pampor, ufilisirã funji trã ligari pamporlu di nghios. Di fricã tra s-nu armãnea tu locuri cu putsãnã apã a Sirtiiljei, apunarã angurãli sh-ashãtsi njidzea dit tu unã parti tu alanta. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Metsi furtuna nã plãscãnea cu fuchii, alantã dzuã arcãmã ncãrcãtura tu amari. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Tu dzua a treia, arcãmã cu mãnjili a noastri tu amari hãlãtsili a pamporlui. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Di multi dzãli nu vidzum nitsi soarili, nitsi stealili. Furtuna cãt yinea s-fãtsea ma vãrtoasã sh-ashãtsi noi chirum nãdia trã ascãpari. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Dupã tsi nu aveam mãcat di multu chiro, Pavlu si sculã sh-dzãsi: “Bãrbats, prindea s-mi aveat ascultat shi s-nu earam nchisit di Creta. Ashãtsi va aveam ascãpat di aestu piricljiu sh-di aestã zãrari. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Tora vã urnipsescu tra s-hits cu curaiu, cã vãrã banã di noi nu va chearã, di cãt mash pamporlu. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Aestã noapti nji si fãnirusi un anghil a Dumnidzãlui, a cui escu sh-mini sh-a cui lji huzmitipsescu, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />sh-nji-dzãsi: ‘S-nu ai fricã, Pavle. Tini prindi s-eshi nãintea a Cesarului, trã atsea Dumnidzãlu lji ari ascãpat tuts atselji tsi nãftescu cu tini.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Trã atsea, loats curaiu, bãrbats, cã mini am pisti la Dumnidzãlu cã va si s-facã ashãtsi cum nji dzãsi. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Noi va s-agiundzem tu vãrã insulã.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Eara noaptea a patrusprãdzatsea shi, iarã ma nãfteam tu amarea Adriaticã, aproapi di njeadzã-noapti naftsãlji minduirã cã ma s-apruchea a loclui. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Atumtsea arcarã misurãtoara di ahãndami sh-vidzurã cã ahãndamea eara treidzãtsi shi shapti di metri, deapoea niheamã ma diparti eara vãrã optusprãyinghits di metri. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Di fricã tra s-nu si s-plãscãnea tu vãrã shcãmbã, arcarã patru anguri shi s-rugarã s-fãtsea dzuã. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Naftsãlji vrurã s-alãsa pamporlu sh-trã atsea avea apunat varca a ascãpariljei tu amari, taha va arca angurãli dit pampor. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Pavlu lj-dzãsi a tsenturionlui sh-a suldatsilor: “Macã aeshti oaminji nu armãn tu pampor, voi nu va putets s-vã ascãpats.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Atumtsea suldatslji tãljarã funjli di varca a ascãpariljei sh-u alãsarã s-cadã pri amari. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Iarã ashtipta s-apirea, Pavlu lã urnipsea tuts s-mãca tsiva sh-lã dzãsi: “Azã easti dzua a patrusprãdzatsea tsi ashtiptats, hits ni-mãcats sh-cu foami. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Trã atsea vã-dimãndu s-mãcats tsiva, macã vrets s-bãnats. Avets ananghi di ascãparea a voastrã. Vãrã di voi nu va chearã nitsi un hir di per dit caplu a lui.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Dupã tsi dzãsi aesti, lo pãnea, hãristisi Dumnidzãlu nãintea a tutulor sh-cum u frãmsi ahurhi s-mãcã. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Atumtsea tuts loarã curaiu sh-mãcarã. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Tuts deadun s-fãtsea doauã suti shaptidzãtsi shasi di sufliti tu pampor. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Dupã tsi s-fãnãtirã, arcarã grãnlu tu amari tra s-lishura pamporlu. <verse eid="ACT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Cãndu apiri, vidzurã loc, ma nu shtia cã iu eara. Atumtsea vidzurã un sin tu amari cu un meal arinos sh-atsia apofãsirã si scutea pamporlu ma s-putea. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ashãtsi dizligarã angurãli dit pampor sh-li alãsarã s-cadã tu amari. Tu idyia oarã sãlãghirã funjli a timonjilor. Deapoea scularã pãndzili di nãintea a pamporlui cãtrã vimtul shi s-dusirã cãtrã meal. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ma pamporlu deadi tu un loc cu putsãnã apã sh-armasi cu caplu tu arinã. Caplu s-hipsi tu arinã iarã coada ma s-dãrãma di fuchia a vãljurilor. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Suldatslji minduirã s-vãtãma hãpsãnitslji, tsi vãrã di elji s-nu ascãpa anotãnda. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ma tsenturionlu, tsi vrea s-ascãpa Pavlul, lji nchidicã s-fãtsea aestã. Elu lji ursi atselji tsi putea s-anoatã, s-aruca protslji tu apã shi s-isha tu loc. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Iarã alantsãlji si s-acãtsa dupã vãrã scãndurã icã si s-acãtsa dupã vãrã bãcatã armasã dit pampor. Ashãtsi tuts agiumsirã sãnãtoshi sh-ghini tu loc.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Agiumsi Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Dupã tsi ascãpãm, nvitsãm cã insula s-acljima Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bãnãtorlji aspusirã unã bunã-vreari mari cãtrã noi. Elji apreasirã un foc sh-nã adunarã tuts noi anvãrliga di foc, cã avea apãrnjitã ploaia sh-eara arcoari. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pavlu avea adunatã un brats di leamni sh-ma li bãga tu foc. Atumtsea lji si anvãrti tu mãnã unã nãpãrticã tsi ishi di cãldura. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Cãndu u-vidzurã nãpãrtica tsi si spindzura tu mãna a lui, locuitorlji dzãsirã cu un-alantu: “Aestu bãrbat prindi s-hibã vãtãmãtor cã, cu tutã cã ascãpã di amarea, ndriptatea tsereascã nu lu alãsã s-bãneadzã.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Pavlu u scuturã di mãnã nãpãrtica tu foc sh-nu pãtsã tsiva. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Elji ma ashtipta tsi si umfla mãna, icã s-cãdea trãoarã mortu. Dupã tsi ashtiptarã multu, sh-a lui nu ma lji undzea tsiva alãxirã minduirea sh-dzãsirã cã elu eara dumnidzã. <verse eid="ACT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Aproapi di atsel loc eara agrili a ma marlui a insuliljei cu numa Publiu. Elu nã ashtiptã sh-nã tsãnu ca oaspits di trei dzãli. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tatã-su al Publiu eara lãndzit tu pat cu hevri sh-cu dizanterii. Pavlu lji s-apruche a lui, s-rugã, timsi mãnjili pristi nãsu sh-lu vindicã. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Dupã tsi undzi aestã, sh-alantsã lãndzits tu insulã yinea la nãsu shi s-vindica. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Elji nã tinjisirã multu sh-cãndu ma nã nchiseam nã deadirã multi lucri trã cai aveam ananghi.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agiundzearea al Pavlu Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Dupã trei meshi nã nchisim cu un pampor di Alexandria tsi avea tricut iarna tu insulã sh-avea ca emblemã Dioscurilji. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Agiumsim Siracuza sh-dãnãsim aclo trei dzãli. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Deapoea nãftim ningã meal sh-agiumsim tu Regio. Alantã dzuã apãrnji si suflã vimtul dit sud sh-dzua a doaua agiumsim tu Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Aclo aflãm niscãntsã frats cai nã si rugarã s-armãneam cu nãshi shapti dzãli. Ashãtsi noi agiumsim Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Fratslji tsi eara aclo, cãndu avdzãrã trã noi, vinirã di la Forlu al Apiu sh-di la Trei Tavernili trã adunari cu noi. Cãndu Pavlu lji vidzu, hãristisi Dumnidzãlu shi s-inimusi. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Cãndu agiumsim Roma, al Pavlu lji deadirã volje s-bãna singur sh-lji bãgarã un suldat s-lu vigljea.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Preadicã tu Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Dupã trei dzãli Pavlu acljimã mãrlji a Iudeilor sh-cãndu s-adunarã lã dzãsi: “Frats, cu tutã cã nu am faptã tsiva contra a popului a meu icã contra a adetsilor a pãrintsãlor a noshtri, mi acãtsarã tu Ierusalem sh-mi prideadirã tu mãnjili a Romanjilor. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Dupã tsi mi loarã tu ntribari, Romanjlji vrurã s-mi sãlãghea cã nu aflarã vãrã cãbati tra s-axizescu moartea. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ma Iudeilji ncuntrarã sh-mini fui anãngãsit s-caftu s-mi giudic di Cezarlu, ma nu cã am tsiva trã acuzari fara a mea. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Trã atsea am cãftat s-vã ved shi si zburãscu cu voi, cã escu ligat cu aesti prãnghi trã nãdia al Israel.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Elji lji dzãsirã: “Noi nu avem loat nitsiunã carti di Iudea trã tini sh-vãrã di fratslji Iudei tsi au vinit aoa, nu nã ari spusã tsiva arãu trã tini. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Cu tutã atsea noi vrem s-avdzãm di la tini tsi mindueshti, cã shtim cã trã aestã sectã iutsido s-greashti contra.” <verse eid="ACT 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Elji arãdãpsirã unã dzuã tra s-aduna Pavlul, sh-multsã oaminji s-dusirã aclo iu bãna elu. Di dimineatsa sh-pãnã seara elu lã nvitsa sh-lã predica trã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui shi-cãfta s-lji cãndãrsea dupã Legea al Moisiu sh-a Prufitsilor trã Isusul. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Niscãntsã s-cãndãrsirã trã atseali tsi dzãsi, iarã alantsãlji nu pistipsirã. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ashãtsi elji nu cãdzurã pi unã minti cu un-alantu sh-cãndu ma fudzea, Pavlu lã dzãsi: “Ghini vã grãi Duhlu Sãmtu a pãrintsãlor a voshtri prit prufitlu Isaia:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘Duti la populu aestu sh-dzã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Cu ureclji va avdzãts ma nu va aduchits tsiva,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">sh-cu oclji va mutrits ma nu va videts tsiva.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Inima a aishtui popul easti faptã nisãmtsãtã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">urecljili a lor greli sh-nu avdu, au ncljisã ocljilji a lor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">tra s-nu veadã cu oclji shi s-nu avdã cu ureclji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">s-nu aducheascã cu inima shi s-toarnã s-lji vindicã mini.”’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Trã atsea nvitsats cã ascãparea a Dumnidzãlui lji si pitricu a pãngãnjilor sh-elji va ascultã!”<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Dupã tsi li dzãsi aesti, Iudeilji fudzirã sh-avurã mari ngrãnji namisa di nãshi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu versu nu s-aflã tu tuti manuscrisili atseali veaclji.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pavlu armasi doi anji ntredzi tu casa tsi avea loat cu nichi sh-ashtipta tuts atselji tsi yinea la nãsu. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Elu lã predica amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu sh-lã nvitsa alihea trã Domnul Isus Hristos cu multu curaiu sh-fãrã s-cheadicã.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>